  },
  "scriptDeadline01": "Hi. I'm here with you.",
  "@scriptDeadline01": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as meditate/deadline/01.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptDeadline02": "For the next ten minutes, the deadline can wait outside the door. It will still be there when you come back, and you'll meet it with a clearer mind.",
  "@scriptDeadline02": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as meditate/deadline/02.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptDeadline03": "Find a position where your body is supported. Feet flat on the floor. Hands resting wherever they want to rest.",
  "@scriptDeadline03": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as meditate/deadline/03.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptDeadline04": "Now let your eyes find one small point in front of you… a spot on the wall, the edge of the desk… and simply rest your gaze there.",
  "@scriptDeadline04": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as meditate/deadline/04.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptDeadline05": "Keep looking at it… and notice how your eyelids may start to feel a little heavier… a little slower to blink.",
  "@scriptDeadline05": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as meditate/deadline/05.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptDeadline06": "There's nothing you need to do right. Whenever they're ready… you can let your eyes close.",
  "@scriptDeadline06": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as meditate/deadline/06.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptDeadline07": "Let's slow the breath together. A longer out-breath tells your body you are safe.",
  "@scriptDeadline07": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as meditate/deadline/07.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptDeadline08": "Breathe in… two… three… four. And out… two… three… four… five… six.",
  "@scriptDeadline08": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as meditate/deadline/08.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptDeadline09": "Again. In… two… three… four. And slowly out… letting the shoulders fall… five… six.",
  "@scriptDeadline09": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as meditate/deadline/09.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptDeadline10": "Good. Let the breath find its own rhythm now.",
  "@scriptDeadline10": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as meditate/deadline/10.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptDeadline11": "In a moment I'll count down from ten to one. With each number, you can drift twice as deep into calm… and you don't have to try. Just listen.",
  "@scriptDeadline11": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as meditate/deadline/11.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptDeadline12": "Ten… letting go.",
  "@scriptDeadline12": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as meditate/deadline/12.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptDeadline13": "Nine… softer now.",
  "@scriptDeadline13": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as meditate/deadline/13.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptDeadline14": "Eight… the noise of the day moving further away.",
  "@scriptDeadline14": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as meditate/deadline/14.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptDeadline15": "Seven…",
  "@scriptDeadline15": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as meditate/deadline/15.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptDeadline16": "Six… deeper and calmer.",
  "@scriptDeadline16": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as meditate/deadline/16.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptDeadline17": "Five… halfway down, and comfortable.",
  "@scriptDeadline17": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as meditate/deadline/17.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptDeadline18": "Four…",
  "@scriptDeadline18": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as meditate/deadline/18.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptDeadline19": "Three… every breath carrying you down.",
  "@scriptDeadline19": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as meditate/deadline/19.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptDeadline20": "Two… almost there.",
  "@scriptDeadline20": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as meditate/deadline/20.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptDeadline21": "And one.",
  "@scriptDeadline21": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as meditate/deadline/21.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptDeadline22": "Resting here. Quiet. Safe.",
  "@scriptDeadline22": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as meditate/deadline/22.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptDeadline23": "Pressure at work often hides in the same few places. Let's visit each one… and let it soften.",
  "@scriptDeadline23": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as meditate/deadline/23.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptDeadline24": "Start with your forehead. The place that frowns at screens and emails. Imagine a warm hand resting there… smoothing it out…",
  "@scriptDeadline24": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as meditate/deadline/24.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptDeadline25": "Now your jaw. Let your teeth part just a little. Let your tongue rest. So much of the day gets held in the jaw… and you can let it go now.",
  "@scriptDeadline25": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as meditate/deadline/25.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptDeadline26": "Your neck and shoulders. Picture them as if they've been lifted toward your ears all day… and now, with your next out-breath… they drop. Heavy. Warm.",
  "@scriptDeadline26": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as meditate/deadline/26.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptDeadline27": "Down through your arms… your wrists, tired from typing… your hands. Let your fingers become loose and still.",
  "@scriptDeadline27": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as meditate/deadline/27.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptDeadline28": "Now your chest and belly. Notice if there's a tightness there, a knot of urgency. You don't need to fight it.",
  "@scriptDeadline28": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as meditate/deadline/28.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptDeadline29": "Just breathe into it… and on the out-breath, imagine it loosening… one thread at a time.",
  "@scriptDeadline29": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as meditate/deadline/29.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptDeadline30": "Your lower back… your hips… your legs… all the way down to your feet on the floor. Grounded. Supported. Nothing to hold up right now.",
  "@scriptDeadline30": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as meditate/deadline/30.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptDeadline31": "Your whole body, calm and heavy and safe.",
  "@scriptDeadline31": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as meditate/deadline/31.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptDeadline32": "Now imagine you're standing on a quiet beach, like the one in the app. Warm sand under your feet. The sea moving in… and out… in its own time.",
  "@scriptDeadline32": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as meditate/deadline/32.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptDeadline33": "Notice the waves never rush. Each one arrives… does what it needs to do… and makes room for the next.",
  "@scriptDeadline33": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as meditate/deadline/33.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptDeadline34": "Your work can be like that. One wave. One task. Then the next.",
  "@scriptDeadline34": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as meditate/deadline/34.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptDeadline35": "And as you rest here, let these words settle somewhere deep, where they can quietly work for you:",
  "@scriptDeadline35": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as meditate/deadline/35.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptDeadline36": "Your worth is not your workload.",
  "@scriptDeadline36": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as meditate/deadline/36.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptDeadline37": "You have handled deadlines before, and you can handle this one.",
  "@scriptDeadline37": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as meditate/deadline/37.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptDeadline38": "A calm mind works faster than a panicked one.",
  "@scriptDeadline38": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as meditate/deadline/38.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptDeadline39": "Doing one thing well is enough.",
  "@scriptDeadline39": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as meditate/deadline/39.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptDeadline40": "Now, gently press the tip of your thumb against the tip of your index finger.",
  "@scriptDeadline40": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as meditate/deadline/40.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptDeadline41": "Take one slow breath… and silently say to yourself: one thing at a time.",
  "@scriptDeadline41": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as meditate/deadline/41.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptDeadline42": "Feel this calm gathering at your fingertips. From now on, whenever the pressure rises at work… in a meeting, before you hit send, when the clock feels loud…",
  "@scriptDeadline42": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as meditate/deadline/42.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptDeadline43": "you can press thumb and finger together, take one breath, and this same calm will return, a little stronger each time.",
  "@scriptDeadline43": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as meditate/deadline/43.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptDeadline44": "Release your fingers now.",
  "@scriptDeadline44": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as meditate/deadline/44.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptDeadline45": "Before we come back, choose one small thing you'll do in the next hour. Just one. The first step, not the whole mountain.",
  "@scriptDeadline45": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as meditate/deadline/45.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptDeadline46": "See yourself doing it calmly.",
  "@scriptDeadline46": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as meditate/deadline/46.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptDeadline47": "Now I'll count from one to five. With each number you'll feel more awake, more alert… bringing the calm back with you.",
  "@scriptDeadline47": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as meditate/deadline/47.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptDeadline48": "One… noticing the chair beneath you.",
  "@scriptDeadline48": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as meditate/deadline/48.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptDeadline49": "Two… sounds of the room returning.",
  "@scriptDeadline49": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as meditate/deadline/49.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptDeadline50": "Three… a deeper breath, wiggling your fingers and toes.",
  "@scriptDeadline50": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as meditate/deadline/50.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptDeadline51": "Four… energy flowing back, clear and focused.",
  "@scriptDeadline51": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as meditate/deadline/51.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptDeadline52": "And five… eyes open when you're ready, calm, clear and ready.",
  "@scriptDeadline52": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as meditate/deadline/52.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptDeadline53": "Well done. Remember: one thing at a time. I'm here with you.",
  "@scriptDeadline53": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as meditate/deadline/53.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSos01": "I'm here with you. You don't have to fix anything right now.",
  "@scriptSos01": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as meditate/sos/01.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSos02": "Put one hand on your chest. Breathe in slowly for four… and out for six.",
  "@scriptSos02": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as meditate/sos/02.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSos03": "Now notice your feet on the ground. Press them down gently. You are here, and you are safe.",
  "@scriptSos03": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as meditate/sos/03.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSos04": "One more slow breath. In… and out. Well done.",
  "@scriptSos04": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as meditate/sos/04.mp3)."
  },
