  "@scriptHomeFull47": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute Home session (recorded as meditate/home_full/47.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptHomeFull49": "Two… sounds of the room returning.",
  "@scriptHomeFull49": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute Home session (recorded as meditate/home_full/49.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptHomeFull50": "Three… a deeper breath, wiggling your fingers and toes.",
  "@scriptHomeFull50": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute Home session (recorded as meditate/home_full/50.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptHomeFull01": "Hi. I'm here with you.",
  "@scriptHomeFull01": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute Home session (recorded as meditate/home_full/01.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptHomeFull02": "For the next ten minutes, everything at home can wait. The chores, the messages, the people who need you. They'll still be there when you come back, and you'll meet them feeling softer.",
  "@scriptHomeFull02": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute Home session (recorded as meditate/home_full/02.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptHomeFull03": "Find a position where your body is supported. Sit back, or lie down. Let your hands rest wherever they want to rest.",
  "@scriptHomeFull03": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute Home session (recorded as meditate/home_full/03.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptHomeFull04": "Now let your eyes find one small point in front of you… a corner of the room, a soft patch of light… and simply rest your gaze there.",
  "@scriptHomeFull04": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute Home session (recorded as meditate/home_full/04.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptHomeFull05": "Keep looking at it… and notice how your eyelids may start to feel a little heavier… a little slower to blink.",
  "@scriptHomeFull05": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute Home session (recorded as meditate/home_full/05.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptHomeFull06": "There's nothing you need to fix right now. Whenever they're ready… you can let your eyes close.",
  "@scriptHomeFull06": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute Home session (recorded as meditate/home_full/06.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptHomeFull07": "Let's slow the breath together. A longer out-breath tells your body it can rest.",
  "@scriptHomeFull07": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute Home session (recorded as meditate/home_full/07.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptHomeFull14": "Eight… the sounds of the house moving further away.",
  "@scriptHomeFull14": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute Home session (recorded as meditate/home_full/14.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptHomeFull23": "Stress at home often settles in the same few places. Let's visit each one… and let it soften.",
  "@scriptHomeFull23": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute Home session (recorded as meditate/home_full/23.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptHomeFull24": "Start with your forehead. The place that tightens when the house gets loud. Imagine a warm hand resting there… smoothing it out…",
  "@scriptHomeFull24": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute Home session (recorded as meditate/home_full/24.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptHomeFull25": "Now your jaw. Let your teeth part just a little. Let your tongue rest. So many words get held back at home… and you can let them go now.",
  "@scriptHomeFull25": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute Home session (recorded as meditate/home_full/25.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptHomeFull26": "Your neck and shoulders. Picture them carrying every task and every person who needed something from you… and now, with your next out-breath… they drop. Heavy. Warm.",
  "@scriptHomeFull26": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute Home session (recorded as meditate/home_full/26.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptHomeFull27": "Down through your arms… your hands that cooked, carried, tidied and held… Let your fingers become loose and still.",
  "@scriptHomeFull27": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute Home session (recorded as meditate/home_full/27.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptHomeFull28": "Now your chest and belly. Notice if there's a heaviness there, a knot of worry for the people you love. You don't need to fight it.",
  "@scriptHomeFull28": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute Home session (recorded as meditate/home_full/28.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptHomeFull30": "Your lower back… your hips… your legs… all the way down to your feet. Grounded. Supported. Nothing to hold up right now.",
  "@scriptHomeFull30": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute Home session (recorded as meditate/home_full/30.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptHomeFull32": "Now imagine you're sitting by a warm fire, like the one in the app. Its glow on your face. The quiet crackle of the wood.",
  "@scriptHomeFull32": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute Home session (recorded as meditate/home_full/32.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptHomeFull33": "Notice the fire never hurries. It burns slowly and steadily… warming the whole room without trying.",
  "@scriptHomeFull33": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute Home session (recorded as meditate/home_full/33.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptHomeFull34": "You can be like that at home. Steady. Warm. You don't have to do everything to be enough.",
  "@scriptHomeFull34": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute Home session (recorded as meditate/home_full/34.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptHomeFull36": "I can care for others and still care for myself.",
  "@scriptHomeFull36": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute Home session (recorded as meditate/home_full/36.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptHomeFull37": "Rest is not something I have to earn.",
  "@scriptHomeFull37": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute Home session (recorded as meditate/home_full/37.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptHomeFull38": "I don't have to fix everything today.",
  "@scriptHomeFull38": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute Home session (recorded as meditate/home_full/38.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptHomeFull39": "Calm at home can start with me.",
  "@scriptHomeFull39": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute Home session (recorded as meditate/home_full/39.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptHomeFull41": "Take one slow breath… and silently say to yourself: I am at home in myself.",
  "@scriptHomeFull41": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute Home session (recorded as meditate/home_full/41.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptHomeFull42": "Feel this calm gathering at your fingertips. From now on, whenever home feels heavy… in a raised voice, a pile of chores, a long evening…",
  "@scriptHomeFull42": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute Home session (recorded as meditate/home_full/42.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptHomeFull45": "Before we come back, choose one small, kind thing you'll do for yourself today. Just one. A cup of tea, a few quiet minutes, an early night.",
  "@scriptHomeFull45": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute Home session (recorded as meditate/home_full/45.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptHomeFull48": "One… noticing what's beneath you.",
  "@scriptHomeFull48": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute Home session (recorded as meditate/home_full/48.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptHomeFull51": "Four… energy flowing back, warm and steady.",
  "@scriptHomeFull51": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute Home session (recorded as meditate/home_full/51.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptHomeFull52": "And five… eyes open when you're ready, calm, rested and ready.",
  "@scriptHomeFull52": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute Home session (recorded as meditate/home_full/52.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptHomeFull53": "Well done. Remember: you are at home in yourself. I'm here with you.",
  "@scriptHomeFull53": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute Home session (recorded as meditate/home_full/53.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSchoolFull09": "Again. In… two… three… four. And slowly out… letting the shoulders fall… five… six.",
  "@scriptSchoolFull09": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute School session (recorded as meditate/school_full/09.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSchoolFull08": "Breathe in… two… three… four. And out… two… three… four… five… six.",
  "@scriptSchoolFull08": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute School session (recorded as meditate/school_full/08.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSchoolFull10": "Good. Let the breath find its own rhythm now.",
  "@scriptSchoolFull10": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute School session (recorded as meditate/school_full/10.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSchoolFull11": "In a moment I'll count down from ten to one. With each number, you can drift twice as deep into calm… and you don't have to try. Just listen.",
  "@scriptSchoolFull11": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute School session (recorded as meditate/school_full/11.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSchoolFull12": "Ten… letting go.",
  "@scriptSchoolFull12": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute School session (recorded as meditate/school_full/12.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSchoolFull13": "Nine… softer now.",
  "@scriptSchoolFull13": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute School session (recorded as meditate/school_full/13.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSchoolFull15": "Seven…",
  "@scriptSchoolFull15": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute School session (recorded as meditate/school_full/15.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSchoolFull16": "Six… deeper and calmer.",
  "@scriptSchoolFull16": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute School session (recorded as meditate/school_full/16.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSchoolFull17": "Five… halfway down, and comfortable.",
  "@scriptSchoolFull17": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute School session (recorded as meditate/school_full/17.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSchoolFull18": "Four…",
  "@scriptSchoolFull18": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute School session (recorded as meditate/school_full/18.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSchoolFull19": "Three… every breath carrying you down.",
  "@scriptSchoolFull19": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute School session (recorded as meditate/school_full/19.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSchoolFull20": "Two… almost there.",
  "@scriptSchoolFull20": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute School session (recorded as meditate/school_full/20.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSchoolFull21": "And one.",
  "@scriptSchoolFull21": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute School session (recorded as meditate/school_full/21.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSchoolFull22": "Resting here. Quiet. Safe.",
  "@scriptSchoolFull22": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute School session (recorded as meditate/school_full/22.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSchoolFull29": "Just breathe into it… and on the out-breath, imagine it loosening… one thread at a time.",
  "@scriptSchoolFull29": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute School session (recorded as meditate/school_full/29.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSchoolFull31": "Your whole body, calm and heavy and safe.",
  "@scriptSchoolFull31": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute School session (recorded as meditate/school_full/31.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSchoolFull35": "And as you rest here, let these words settle somewhere deep, where they can quietly work for you:",
  "@scriptSchoolFull35": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute School session (recorded as meditate/school_full/35.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSchoolFull40": "Now, gently press the tip of your thumb against the tip of your index finger.",
  "@scriptSchoolFull40": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute School session (recorded as meditate/school_full/40.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSchoolFull43": "you can press thumb and finger together, take one breath, and this same calm will return, a little stronger each time.",
  "@scriptSchoolFull43": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute School session (recorded as meditate/school_full/43.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSchoolFull44": "Release your fingers now.",
  "@scriptSchoolFull44": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute School session (recorded as meditate/school_full/44.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSchoolFull46": "See yourself doing it calmly.",
  "@scriptSchoolFull46": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute School session (recorded as meditate/school_full/46.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSchoolFull47": "Now I'll count from one to five. With each number you'll feel more awake, more alert… bringing the calm back with you.",
  "@scriptSchoolFull47": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute School session (recorded as meditate/school_full/47.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSchoolFull49": "Two… sounds of the room returning.",
  "@scriptSchoolFull49": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute School session (recorded as meditate/school_full/49.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSchoolFull50": "Three… a deeper breath, wiggling your fingers and toes.",
  "@scriptSchoolFull50": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute School session (recorded as meditate/school_full/50.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSchoolFull01": "Hi. I'm here with you.",
  "@scriptSchoolFull01": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute School session (recorded as meditate/school_full/01.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSchoolFull02": "For the next ten minutes, the studying can wait outside the door. The notes, the assignments, the exams. They'll still be there when you come back, and you'll meet them with a clearer mind.",
  "@scriptSchoolFull02": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute School session (recorded as meditate/school_full/02.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSchoolFull03": "Find a position where your body is supported. Feet flat on the floor. Hands resting wherever they want to rest.",
  "@scriptSchoolFull03": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute School session (recorded as meditate/school_full/03.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSchoolFull04": "Now let your eyes find one small point in front of you… a spot on the wall, the edge of your desk… and simply rest your gaze there.",
  "@scriptSchoolFull04": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute School session (recorded as meditate/school_full/04.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSchoolFull05": "Keep looking at it… and notice how your eyelids may start to feel a little heavier… a little slower to blink.",
  "@scriptSchoolFull05": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute School session (recorded as meditate/school_full/05.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSchoolFull06": "There's nothing you need to get right. Whenever they're ready… you can let your eyes close.",
  "@scriptSchoolFull06": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute School session (recorded as meditate/school_full/06.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSchoolFull07": "Let's slow the breath together. A longer out-breath tells your body you are safe.",
  "@scriptSchoolFull07": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute School session (recorded as meditate/school_full/07.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSchoolFull14": "Eight… the pages and the pressure moving further away.",
  "@scriptSchoolFull14": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute School session (recorded as meditate/school_full/14.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSchoolFull23": "Studying often leaves tension in the same few places. Let's visit each one… and let it soften.",
  "@scriptSchoolFull23": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute School session (recorded as meditate/school_full/23.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSchoolFull24": "Start with your forehead. The place that frowns over notes and screens. Imagine a warm hand resting there… smoothing it out…",
  "@scriptSchoolFull24": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute School session (recorded as meditate/school_full/24.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSchoolFull25": "Now your jaw. Let your teeth part just a little. Let your tongue rest. So much concentration gets held in the jaw… and you can let it go now.",
  "@scriptSchoolFull25": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute School session (recorded as meditate/school_full/25.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSchoolFull26": "Your neck and shoulders. Picture them hunched over books and laptops for hours… and now, with your next out-breath… they drop. Heavy. Warm.",
  "@scriptSchoolFull26": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute School session (recorded as meditate/school_full/26.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSchoolFull27": "Down through your arms… your wrists, tired from writing… your hands. Let your fingers become loose and still.",
  "@scriptSchoolFull27": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute School session (recorded as meditate/school_full/27.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSchoolFull28": "Now your chest and belly. Notice if there's a tightness there, a knot of worry about grades or what comes next. You don't need to fight it.",
  "@scriptSchoolFull28": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute School session (recorded as meditate/school_full/28.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSchoolFull30": "Your lower back… your hips… your legs… all the way down to your feet on the floor. Grounded. Supported. Nothing to hold up right now.",
  "@scriptSchoolFull30": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute School session (recorded as meditate/school_full/30.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSchoolFull32": "Now imagine you're standing in a quiet, snowy field, like the one in the app. Cool, fresh air. Soft snow falling all around you.",
  "@scriptSchoolFull32": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute School session (recorded as meditate/school_full/32.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSchoolFull33": "Notice each snowflake falls in its own time. It never rushes… it simply lands, and makes room for the next.",
  "@scriptSchoolFull33": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute School session (recorded as meditate/school_full/33.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSchoolFull34": "Your studying can be like that. One page. One topic. Then the next.",
  "@scriptSchoolFull34": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute School session (recorded as meditate/school_full/34.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSchoolFull36": "I am more than my grades.",
  "@scriptSchoolFull36": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute School session (recorded as meditate/school_full/36.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSchoolFull37": "I have learned hard things before, and I can learn this too.",
  "@scriptSchoolFull37": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute School session (recorded as meditate/school_full/37.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSchoolFull38": "A rested mind remembers more than a panicked one.",
  "@scriptSchoolFull38": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute School session (recorded as meditate/school_full/38.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSchoolFull39": "Small steps, taken every day, add up.",
  "@scriptSchoolFull39": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute School session (recorded as meditate/school_full/39.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSchoolFull41": "Take one slow breath… and silently say to yourself: one page at a time.",
  "@scriptSchoolFull41": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute School session (recorded as meditate/school_full/41.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSchoolFull42": "Feel this calm gathering at your fingertips. From now on, whenever the pressure rises at school… before an exam, in a busy library, when the to-do list feels endless…",
  "@scriptSchoolFull42": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute School session (recorded as meditate/school_full/42.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSchoolFull45": "Before we come back, choose one small thing you'll study next. Just one. The first page, not the whole book.",
  "@scriptSchoolFull45": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute School session (recorded as meditate/school_full/45.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSchoolFull48": "One… noticing the chair beneath you.",
  "@scriptSchoolFull48": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute School session (recorded as meditate/school_full/48.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSchoolFull51": "Four… energy flowing back, clear and focused.",
  "@scriptSchoolFull51": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute School session (recorded as meditate/school_full/51.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSchoolFull52": "And five… eyes open when you're ready, calm, clear and ready.",
  "@scriptSchoolFull52": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute School session (recorded as meditate/school_full/52.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSchoolFull53": "Well done. Remember: one page at a time. I'm here with you.",
  "@scriptSchoolFull53": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute School session (recorded as meditate/school_full/53.mp3)."
  },
