  },
  "scriptSocialFull49": "Two… sounds of the room returning.",
  "@scriptSocialFull49": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute Social session (recorded as meditate/social_full/49.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialFull50": "Three… a deeper breath, wiggling your fingers and toes.",
  "@scriptSocialFull50": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute Social session (recorded as meditate/social_full/50.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialFull01": "Hi. I'm here with you.",
  "@scriptSocialFull01": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute Social session (recorded as meditate/social_full/01.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialFull02": "For the next ten minutes, what other people think can wait outside the door. The conversations, the messages, the replaying of what was said. You'll come back to them feeling steadier.",
  "@scriptSocialFull02": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute Social session (recorded as meditate/social_full/02.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialFull03": "Find a position where your body is supported. Feet flat on the floor. Hands resting wherever they want to rest.",
  "@scriptSocialFull03": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute Social session (recorded as meditate/social_full/03.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialFull04": "Now let your eyes find one small point in front of you… a spot on the wall, a patch of light… and simply rest your gaze there.",
  "@scriptSocialFull04": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute Social session (recorded as meditate/social_full/04.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialFull05": "Keep looking at it… and notice how your eyelids may start to feel a little heavier… a little slower to blink.",
  "@scriptSocialFull05": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute Social session (recorded as meditate/social_full/05.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialFull06": "There's nothing you need to say or do right. Whenever they're ready… you can let your eyes close.",
  "@scriptSocialFull06": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute Social session (recorded as meditate/social_full/06.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialFull07": "Let's slow the breath together. A longer out-breath tells your body you are safe.",
  "@scriptSocialFull07": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute Social session (recorded as meditate/social_full/07.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialFull14": "Eight… other people's voices moving further away.",
  "@scriptSocialFull14": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute Social session (recorded as meditate/social_full/14.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialFull23": "Social worry often hides in the same few places in the body. Let's visit each one… and let it soften.",
  "@scriptSocialFull23": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute Social session (recorded as meditate/social_full/23.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialFull24": "Start with your forehead. The place that tightens when you wonder what someone thought. Imagine a warm hand resting there… smoothing it out…",
  "@scriptSocialFull24": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute Social session (recorded as meditate/social_full/24.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialFull25": "Now your jaw. Let your teeth part just a little. Let your tongue rest. So many unsaid words get held in the jaw… and you can let them go now.",
  "@scriptSocialFull25": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute Social session (recorded as meditate/social_full/25.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialFull26": "Your neck and shoulders. Picture them braced for a room full of people… and now, with your next out-breath… they drop. Heavy. Warm.",
  "@scriptSocialFull26": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute Social session (recorded as meditate/social_full/26.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialFull27": "Down through your arms… your hands, perhaps restless, unsure where to rest… Let your fingers become loose and still.",
  "@scriptSocialFull27": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute Social session (recorded as meditate/social_full/27.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialFull28": "Now your chest and belly. Notice if there's a flutter there, a nervous knot before seeing people. You don't need to fight it.",
  "@scriptSocialFull28": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute Social session (recorded as meditate/social_full/28.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialFull30": "Your lower back… your hips… your legs… all the way down to your feet on the floor. Grounded. Supported. Nothing to prove right now.",
  "@scriptSocialFull30": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute Social session (recorded as meditate/social_full/30.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialFull32": "Now imagine you're lying in a wide, open meadow, like the one in the app. Soft grass beneath you. A gentle breeze moving through.",
  "@scriptSocialFull32": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute Social session (recorded as meditate/social_full/32.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialFull33": "Notice the grass bends with the wind… and never breaks. It doesn't hold on. It sways, and settles again.",
  "@scriptSocialFull33": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute Social session (recorded as meditate/social_full/33.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialFull34": "You can be like that with people. Let the moment move through you… and come back to yourself.",
  "@scriptSocialFull34": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute Social session (recorded as meditate/social_full/34.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialFull36": "I am enough as I am.",
  "@scriptSocialFull36": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute Social session (recorded as meditate/social_full/36.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialFull37": "Most people are thinking about themselves, not judging me.",
  "@scriptSocialFull37": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute Social session (recorded as meditate/social_full/37.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialFull38": "I am allowed to take up space.",
  "@scriptSocialFull38": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute Social session (recorded as meditate/social_full/38.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialFull39": "One kind conversation is enough.",
  "@scriptSocialFull39": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute Social session (recorded as meditate/social_full/39.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialFull41": "Take one slow breath… and silently say to yourself: I belong here as I am.",
  "@scriptSocialFull41": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute Social session (recorded as meditate/social_full/41.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialFull42": "Feel this calm gathering at your fingertips. From now on, whenever worry rises around people… before a party, in a group chat, as you walk into a room…",
  "@scriptSocialFull42": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute Social session (recorded as meditate/social_full/42.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialFull45": "Before we come back, choose one small, friendly thing you'll do today. Just one. A smile, a message to a friend, a simple hello.",
  "@scriptSocialFull45": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute Social session (recorded as meditate/social_full/45.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialFull48": "One… noticing what's beneath you.",
  "@scriptSocialFull48": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute Social session (recorded as meditate/social_full/48.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialFull51": "Four… energy flowing back, calm and confident.",
  "@scriptSocialFull51": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute Social session (recorded as meditate/social_full/51.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialFull52": "And five… eyes open when you're ready, calm, steady and ready.",
  "@scriptSocialFull52": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute Social session (recorded as meditate/social_full/52.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialFull53": "Well done. Remember: you belong here as you are. I'm here with you.",
  "@scriptSocialFull53": {
    "description": "Spoken line of the ten-minute Social session (recorded as meditate/social_full/53.mp3)."
  },
