  "meditateChildrenTitle": "Patient Parent",
  "@meditateChildrenTitle": {
    "description": "A home meditation."
  },
  "afterAnchorChildren": "Three slow breaths · “Steady like the lighthouse.”",
  "@afterAnchorChildren": {
    "description": "The anchor card after Patient Parent: the gesture and its words."
  },
  "scriptChildren01": "Hi. I'm here with you.",
  "@scriptChildren01": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Patient Parent (recorded as meditate/children/01.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChildren02": "Caring for children is full of love… and full of noise, needs and no breaks. For these ten minutes, someone is looking after you.",
  "@scriptChildren02": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Patient Parent (recorded as meditate/children/02.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChildren03": "Find a position where your body is supported. Feet flat on the floor. Hands resting wherever they want to rest.",
  "@scriptChildren03": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Patient Parent (recorded as meditate/children/03.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChildren04": "Now let your eyes find one small point in front of you… and simply rest your gaze there.",
  "@scriptChildren04": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Patient Parent (recorded as meditate/children/04.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChildren05": "Keep looking at it… and notice how your eyelids may start to feel a little heavier… a little slower to blink.",
  "@scriptChildren05": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Patient Parent (recorded as meditate/children/05.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChildren06": "There's nothing you need to do right. Whenever they're ready… you can let your eyes close.",
  "@scriptChildren06": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Patient Parent (recorded as meditate/children/06.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChildren07": "Let's slow the breath together. A longer out-breath tells your body you are safe.",
  "@scriptChildren07": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Patient Parent (recorded as meditate/children/07.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChildren08": "Breathe in… two… three… four. And out… two… three… four… five… six.",
  "@scriptChildren08": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Patient Parent (recorded as meditate/children/08.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChildren09": "Again. In… two… three… four. And slowly out… letting the shoulders fall… five… six.",
  "@scriptChildren09": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Patient Parent (recorded as meditate/children/09.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChildren10": "Good. Let the breath find its own rhythm now.",
  "@scriptChildren10": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Patient Parent (recorded as meditate/children/10.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChildren11": "In a moment I'll count down from ten to one. With each number, you can drift twice as deep into calm… and you don't have to try. Just listen.",
  "@scriptChildren11": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Patient Parent (recorded as meditate/children/11.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChildren12": "Ten… letting go.",
  "@scriptChildren12": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Patient Parent (recorded as meditate/children/12.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChildren13": "Nine… softer now.",
  "@scriptChildren13": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Patient Parent (recorded as meditate/children/13.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChildren14": "Eight… the noise of the day moving further away.",
  "@scriptChildren14": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Patient Parent (recorded as meditate/children/14.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChildren15": "Seven…",
  "@scriptChildren15": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Patient Parent (recorded as meditate/children/15.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChildren16": "Six… deeper and calmer.",
  "@scriptChildren16": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Patient Parent (recorded as meditate/children/16.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChildren17": "Five… halfway down, and comfortable.",
  "@scriptChildren17": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Patient Parent (recorded as meditate/children/17.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChildren18": "Four…",
  "@scriptChildren18": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Patient Parent (recorded as meditate/children/18.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChildren19": "Three… every breath carrying you down.",
  "@scriptChildren19": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Patient Parent (recorded as meditate/children/19.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChildren20": "Two… almost there.",
  "@scriptChildren20": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Patient Parent (recorded as meditate/children/20.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChildren21": "And one.",
  "@scriptChildren21": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Patient Parent (recorded as meditate/children/21.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChildren22": "Resting here. Quiet. Safe.",
  "@scriptChildren22": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Patient Parent (recorded as meditate/children/22.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChildren23": "Now let's move slowly through your body… and let the tension soften, wherever it's hiding.",
  "@scriptChildren23": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Patient Parent (recorded as meditate/children/23.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChildren24": "Start with your shoulders. They carry little ones, bags, worries. Let them drop now… heavy and warm.",
  "@scriptChildren24": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Patient Parent (recorded as meditate/children/24.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChildren25": "Your jaw… let your teeth part. Your hands… open them, palms up, as if setting everything down. Nothing needs holding right now.",
  "@scriptChildren25": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Patient Parent (recorded as meditate/children/25.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChildren26": "Take a moment to search gently for anything still holding on… a tight brow, a clenched hand, a held breath. Wherever you find it, breathe in… and as you breathe out, let it melt away.",
  "@scriptChildren26": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Patient Parent (recorded as meditate/children/26.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChildren27": "Down through your hips… your legs… all the way to your feet on the floor. Grounded. Supported. Nothing to hold up right now.",
  "@scriptChildren27": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Patient Parent (recorded as meditate/children/27.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChildren28": "Your whole body… calm and heavy and safe. Enjoy this feeling for a few quiet breaths.",
  "@scriptChildren28": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Patient Parent (recorded as meditate/children/28.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChildren29": "Imagine a lighthouse on a rocky point. All around it, the waves splash, play, crash and laugh.",
  "@scriptChildren29": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Patient Parent (recorded as meditate/children/29.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChildren30": "The lighthouse doesn't chase the waves or shout at them. It simply stands, steady and warm, its light turning slowly. That steadiness is what keeps every boat safe.",
  "@scriptChildren30": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Patient Parent (recorded as meditate/children/30.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChildren31": "And as you rest here, let these words settle somewhere deep, where they can quietly work for you:",
  "@scriptChildren31": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Patient Parent (recorded as meditate/children/31.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChildren32": "You don't have to be a perfect parent to be a good one.",
  "@scriptChildren32": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Patient Parent (recorded as meditate/children/32.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChildren33": "Your calm teaches more than your words.",
  "@scriptChildren33": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Patient Parent (recorded as meditate/children/33.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChildren34": "It's okay to pause before you respond.",
  "@scriptChildren34": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Patient Parent (recorded as meditate/children/34.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChildren35": "Now, gently take three slow breaths.",
  "@scriptChildren35": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Patient Parent (recorded as meditate/children/35.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChildren36": "Take one slow breath… and silently say to yourself: Steady like the lighthouse.",
  "@scriptChildren36": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Patient Parent (recorded as meditate/children/36.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChildren37": "Feel this calm gathering here. From now on, when the noise rises, when tears start, or when you feel your patience slipping, you can do this again… take one breath… and this same calm will return, a little stronger each time.",
  "@scriptChildren37": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Patient Parent (recorded as meditate/children/37.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChildren38": "Let it go now.",
  "@scriptChildren38": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Patient Parent (recorded as meditate/children/38.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChildren39": "Rest here now… nothing to do, nowhere to be… just letting the calm settle in, deeper with every breath.",
  "@scriptChildren39": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Patient Parent (recorded as meditate/children/39.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChildren40": "Before we come back… Choose one small moment today to simply be with your child, without rushing.",
  "@scriptChildren40": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Patient Parent (recorded as meditate/children/40.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChildren41": "See yourself doing it calmly.",
  "@scriptChildren41": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Patient Parent (recorded as meditate/children/41.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChildren42": "Now I'll count from one to five. With each number you'll feel more awake, more alert… bringing the calm back with you.",
  "@scriptChildren42": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Patient Parent (recorded as meditate/children/42.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChildren43": "One… noticing what's beneath you.",
  "@scriptChildren43": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Patient Parent (recorded as meditate/children/43.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChildren44": "Two… sounds of the room returning.",
  "@scriptChildren44": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Patient Parent (recorded as meditate/children/44.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChildren45": "Three… a deeper breath, wiggling your fingers and toes.",
  "@scriptChildren45": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Patient Parent (recorded as meditate/children/45.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChildren46": "Four… energy flowing back, clear and focused.",
  "@scriptChildren46": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Patient Parent (recorded as meditate/children/46.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChildren47": "And five… eyes open when you're ready… calm, clear and ready.",
  "@scriptChildren47": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Patient Parent (recorded as meditate/children/47.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChildren48": "Well done. Remember: Steady like the lighthouse. I'm here with you.",
  "@scriptChildren48": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Patient Parent (recorded as meditate/children/48.mp3)."
  },
  "meditateFamilyTitle": "Peace with Family",
  "@meditateFamilyTitle": {
    "description": "A home meditation."
