    "description": "Spoken line of Peace with Family (recorded as meditate/family/05.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptFamily06": "There's nothing you need to do right. Whenever they're ready… you can let your eyes close.",
  "@scriptFamily06": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Peace with Family (recorded as meditate/family/06.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptFamily07": "Let's slow the breath together. A longer out-breath tells your body you are safe.",
  "@scriptFamily07": {
