  },
  "scriptFamily08": "Breathe in… two… three… four. And out… two… three… four… five… six.",
  "@scriptFamily08": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Peace with Family (recorded as meditate/family/08.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptFamily09": "Again. In… two… three… four. And slowly out… letting the shoulders fall… five… six.",
  "@scriptFamily09": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Peace with Family (recorded as meditate/family/09.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptFamily10": "Good. Let the breath find its own rhythm now.",
  "@scriptFamily10": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Peace with Family (recorded as meditate/family/10.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptFamily11": "In a moment I'll count down from ten to one. With each number, you can drift twice as deep into calm… and you don't have to try. Just listen.",
  "@scriptFamily11": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Peace with Family (recorded as meditate/family/11.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptFamily12": "Ten… letting go.",
  "@scriptFamily12": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Peace with Family (recorded as meditate/family/12.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptFamily13": "Nine… softer now.",
  "@scriptFamily13": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Peace with Family (recorded as meditate/family/13.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptFamily14": "Eight… the noise of the day moving further away.",
  "@scriptFamily14": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Peace with Family (recorded as meditate/family/14.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptFamily15": "Seven…",
  "@scriptFamily15": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Peace with Family (recorded as meditate/family/15.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptFamily16": "Six… deeper and calmer.",
  "@scriptFamily16": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Peace with Family (recorded as meditate/family/16.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptFamily17": "Five… halfway down, and comfortable.",
  "@scriptFamily17": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Peace with Family (recorded as meditate/family/17.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptFamily18": "Four…",
  "@scriptFamily18": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Peace with Family (recorded as meditate/family/18.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptFamily19": "Three… every breath carrying you down.",
  "@scriptFamily19": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Peace with Family (recorded as meditate/family/19.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptFamily20": "Two… almost there.",
  "@scriptFamily20": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Peace with Family (recorded as meditate/family/20.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptFamily21": "And one.",
  "@scriptFamily21": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Peace with Family (recorded as meditate/family/21.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptFamily22": "Resting here. Quiet. Safe.",
  "@scriptFamily22": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Peace with Family (recorded as meditate/family/22.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptFamily23": "Now let's move slowly through your body… and let the tension soften, wherever it's hiding.",
  "@scriptFamily23": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Peace with Family (recorded as meditate/family/23.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptFamily24": "Bring your attention to your stomach. This is where family tension often lives… a knot, a flutter, a heaviness. Breathe into it softly.",
  "@scriptFamily24": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Peace with Family (recorded as meditate/family/24.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptFamily25": "Now your lower back. Imagine warmth spreading across it like sunlight on stone. Let it rest from the weight it's been holding.",
  "@scriptFamily25": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Peace with Family (recorded as meditate/family/25.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptFamily26": "Take a moment to search gently for anything still holding on… a tight brow, a clenched hand, a held breath. Wherever you find it, breathe in… and as you breathe out, let it melt away.",
  "@scriptFamily26": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Peace with Family (recorded as meditate/family/26.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptFamily27": "Down through your hips… your legs… all the way to your feet on the floor. Grounded. Supported. Nothing to hold up right now.",
  "@scriptFamily27": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Peace with Family (recorded as meditate/family/27.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptFamily28": "Your whole body… calm and heavy and safe. Enjoy this feeling for a few quiet breaths.",
  "@scriptFamily28": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Peace with Family (recorded as meditate/family/28.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptFamily29": "Picture a beautiful garden with a low green hedge around it. The gate is open. People can visit, talk and laugh with you.",
  "@scriptFamily29": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Peace with Family (recorded as meditate/family/29.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptFamily30": "And the hedge is still there. Quiet. Protecting what grows inside. You decide when the gate opens… and when it closes.",
  "@scriptFamily30": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Peace with Family (recorded as meditate/family/30.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptFamily31": "And as you rest here, let these words settle somewhere deep, where they can quietly work for you:",
  "@scriptFamily31": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Peace with Family (recorded as meditate/family/31.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptFamily32": "You can love them and still set kind boundaries.",
  "@scriptFamily32": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Peace with Family (recorded as meditate/family/32.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptFamily33": "Old patterns don't have to repeat today.",
  "@scriptFamily33": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Peace with Family (recorded as meditate/family/33.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptFamily34": "Your peace matters too.",
  "@scriptFamily34": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Peace with Family (recorded as meditate/family/34.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptFamily35": "Now, gently press your palms together.",
  "@scriptFamily35": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Peace with Family (recorded as meditate/family/35.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptFamily36": "Take one slow breath… and silently say to yourself: Kind, and clear.",
  "@scriptFamily36": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Peace with Family (recorded as meditate/family/36.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptFamily37": "Feel this calm gathering here. From now on, before a family call, a visit, or a conversation you've been dreading, you can do this again… take one breath… and this same calm will return, a little stronger each time.",
  "@scriptFamily37": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Peace with Family (recorded as meditate/family/37.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptFamily38": "Let it go now.",
  "@scriptFamily38": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Peace with Family (recorded as meditate/family/38.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptFamily39": "Rest here now… nothing to do, nowhere to be… just letting the calm settle in, deeper with every breath.",
  "@scriptFamily39": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Peace with Family (recorded as meditate/family/39.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptFamily40": "Before we come back… Think of one boundary you'd like to keep this week… and how you'd say it kindly.",
  "@scriptFamily40": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Peace with Family (recorded as meditate/family/40.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptFamily41": "See yourself doing it calmly.",
  "@scriptFamily41": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Peace with Family (recorded as meditate/family/41.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptFamily42": "Now I'll count from one to five. With each number you'll feel more awake, more alert… bringing the calm back with you.",
  "@scriptFamily42": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Peace with Family (recorded as meditate/family/42.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptFamily43": "One… noticing what's beneath you.",
  "@scriptFamily43": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Peace with Family (recorded as meditate/family/43.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptFamily44": "Two… sounds of the room returning.",
  "@scriptFamily44": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Peace with Family (recorded as meditate/family/44.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptFamily45": "Three… a deeper breath, wiggling your fingers and toes.",
  "@scriptFamily45": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Peace with Family (recorded as meditate/family/45.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptFamily46": "Four… energy flowing back, clear and focused.",
  "@scriptFamily46": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Peace with Family (recorded as meditate/family/46.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptFamily47": "And five… eyes open when you're ready… calm, clear and ready.",
  "@scriptFamily47": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Peace with Family (recorded as meditate/family/47.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptFamily48": "Well done. Remember: Kind, and clear. I'm here with you.",
  "@scriptFamily48": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Peace with Family (recorded as meditate/family/48.mp3)."
  },
