  },
  "scriptChores22": "Resting here. Quiet. Safe.",
  "@scriptChores22": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Mental Load Release (recorded as meditate/chores/22.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChores23": "Now let's move slowly through your body… and let the tension soften, wherever it's hiding.",
  "@scriptChores23": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Mental Load Release (recorded as meditate/chores/23.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChores24": "Your shoulders and upper back. Imagine every task you're carrying as a weight resting there. Now, breath by breath, feel them become lighter.",
  "@scriptChores24": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Mental Load Release (recorded as meditate/chores/24.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChores25": "Let your arms rest. Your fingers uncurl. You are not holding a phone, a list, a cloth or a bag. Just air.",
  "@scriptChores25": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Mental Load Release (recorded as meditate/chores/25.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChores26": "Take a moment to search gently for anything still holding on… a tight brow, a clenched hand, a held breath. Wherever you find it, breathe in… and as you breathe out, let it melt away.",
  "@scriptChores26": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Mental Load Release (recorded as meditate/chores/26.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChores27": "Down through your hips… your legs… all the way to your feet on the floor. Grounded. Supported. Nothing to hold up right now.",
  "@scriptChores27": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Mental Load Release (recorded as meditate/chores/27.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChores28": "Your whole body… calm and heavy and safe. Enjoy this feeling for a few quiet breaths.",
  "@scriptChores28": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Mental Load Release (recorded as meditate/chores/28.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChores29": "Imagine walking along warm sand, carrying heavy bags in both hands.",
  "@scriptChores29": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Mental Load Release (recorded as meditate/chores/29.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChores30": "One by one, you set them down. The laundry. The dishes. The appointments. The things you're trying to remember.",
  "@scriptChores30": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Mental Load Release (recorded as meditate/chores/30.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChores31": "With each bag you set down, your steps become lighter. The bags will wait. They always do. Right now… you just walk.",
  "@scriptChores31": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Mental Load Release (recorded as meditate/chores/31.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChores32": "And as you rest here, let these words settle somewhere deep, where they can quietly work for you:",
  "@scriptChores32": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Mental Load Release (recorded as meditate/chores/32.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChores33": "The list can wait. You are allowed to rest first.",
  "@scriptChores33": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Mental Load Release (recorded as meditate/chores/33.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChores34": "Asking for help is sharing, not failing.",
  "@scriptChores34": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Mental Load Release (recorded as meditate/chores/34.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChores35": "Done is better than perfect.",
  "@scriptChores35": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Mental Load Release (recorded as meditate/chores/35.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChores36": "Now, gently roll your shoulders slowly back.",
  "@scriptChores36": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Mental Load Release (recorded as meditate/chores/36.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChores37": "Take one slow breath… and silently say to yourself: One thing, then rest.",
  "@scriptChores37": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Mental Load Release (recorded as meditate/chores/37.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChores38": "Feel this calm gathering here. From now on, when the list feels endless, or you notice yourself rushing from task to task, you can do this again… take one breath… and this same calm will return, a little stronger each time.",
  "@scriptChores38": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Mental Load Release (recorded as meditate/chores/38.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChores39": "Let it go now.",
  "@scriptChores39": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Mental Load Release (recorded as meditate/chores/39.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChores40": "Rest here now… nothing to do, nowhere to be… just letting the calm settle in, deeper with every breath.",
  "@scriptChores40": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Mental Load Release (recorded as meditate/chores/40.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChores41": "Before we come back… Choose one task you'll let go of, or ask for help with, today.",
  "@scriptChores41": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Mental Load Release (recorded as meditate/chores/41.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChores42": "See yourself doing it calmly.",
  "@scriptChores42": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Mental Load Release (recorded as meditate/chores/42.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChores43": "Now I'll count from one to five. With each number you'll feel more awake, more alert… bringing the calm back with you.",
  "@scriptChores43": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Mental Load Release (recorded as meditate/chores/43.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChores44": "One… noticing what's beneath you.",
  "@scriptChores44": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Mental Load Release (recorded as meditate/chores/44.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChores45": "Two… sounds of the room returning.",
  "@scriptChores45": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Mental Load Release (recorded as meditate/chores/45.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChores46": "Three… a deeper breath, wiggling your fingers and toes.",
  "@scriptChores46": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Mental Load Release (recorded as meditate/chores/46.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChores47": "Four… energy flowing back, clear and focused.",
  "@scriptChores47": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Mental Load Release (recorded as meditate/chores/47.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChores48": "And five… eyes open when you're ready… calm, clear and ready.",
  "@scriptChores48": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Mental Load Release (recorded as meditate/chores/48.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptChores49": "Well done. Remember: One thing, then rest. I'm here with you.",
  "@scriptChores49": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Mental Load Release (recorded as meditate/chores/49.mp3)."
  },
  "meditateMoneyTitle": "Steady with Money",
  "@meditateMoneyTitle": {
    "description": "A home meditation."
  },
  "afterAnchorMoney": "Feet pressed into the floor · “Rooted and steady.”",
  "@afterAnchorMoney": {
    "description": "The anchor card after Steady with Money: the gesture and its words."
  },
  "scriptMoney01": "Hi. I'm here with you.",
  "@scriptMoney01": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Steady with Money (recorded as meditate/money/01.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMoney02": "Money worries can be loud, especially at night. For these ten minutes, the numbers can wait. You are safe right here.",
  "@scriptMoney02": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Steady with Money (recorded as meditate/money/02.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMoney03": "Find a position where your body is supported. Feet flat on the floor. Hands resting wherever they want to rest.",
  "@scriptMoney03": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Steady with Money (recorded as meditate/money/03.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMoney04": "Now let your eyes find one small point in front of you… and simply rest your gaze there.",
  "@scriptMoney04": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Steady with Money (recorded as meditate/money/04.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMoney05": "Keep looking at it… and notice how your eyelids may start to feel a little heavier… a little slower to blink.",
  "@scriptMoney05": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Steady with Money (recorded as meditate/money/05.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMoney06": "There's nothing you need to do right. Whenever they're ready… you can let your eyes close.",
  "@scriptMoney06": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Steady with Money (recorded as meditate/money/06.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMoney07": "Let's slow the breath together. A longer out-breath tells your body you are safe.",
  "@scriptMoney07": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Steady with Money (recorded as meditate/money/07.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMoney08": "Breathe in… two… three… four. And out… two… three… four… five… six.",
  "@scriptMoney08": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Steady with Money (recorded as meditate/money/08.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMoney09": "Again. In… two… three… four. And slowly out… letting the shoulders fall… five… six.",
  "@scriptMoney09": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Steady with Money (recorded as meditate/money/09.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMoney10": "Good. Let the breath find its own rhythm now.",
  "@scriptMoney10": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Steady with Money (recorded as meditate/money/10.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMoney11": "In a moment I'll count down from ten to one. With each number, you can drift twice as deep into calm… and you don't have to try. Just listen.",
  "@scriptMoney11": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Steady with Money (recorded as meditate/money/11.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMoney12": "Ten… letting go.",
  "@scriptMoney12": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Steady with Money (recorded as meditate/money/12.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMoney13": "Nine… softer now.",
  "@scriptMoney13": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Steady with Money (recorded as meditate/money/13.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMoney14": "Eight… the noise of the day moving further away.",
  "@scriptMoney14": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Steady with Money (recorded as meditate/money/14.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMoney15": "Seven…",
  "@scriptMoney15": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Steady with Money (recorded as meditate/money/15.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMoney16": "Six… deeper and calmer.",
  "@scriptMoney16": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Steady with Money (recorded as meditate/money/16.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMoney17": "Five… halfway down, and comfortable.",
  "@scriptMoney17": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Steady with Money (recorded as meditate/money/17.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMoney18": "Four…",
  "@scriptMoney18": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Steady with Money (recorded as meditate/money/18.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMoney19": "Three… every breath carrying you down.",
  "@scriptMoney19": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Steady with Money (recorded as meditate/money/19.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMoney20": "Two… almost there.",
  "@scriptMoney20": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Steady with Money (recorded as meditate/money/20.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMoney21": "And one.",
  "@scriptMoney21": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Steady with Money (recorded as meditate/money/21.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMoney22": "Resting here. Quiet. Safe.",
  "@scriptMoney22": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Steady with Money (recorded as meditate/money/22.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMoney23": "Now let's move slowly through your body… and let the tension soften, wherever it's hiding.",
  "@scriptMoney23": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Steady with Money (recorded as meditate/money/23.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMoney24": "Bring your attention to your belly. Money stress often sits here, tight and anxious. Let it rise and fall with your breath. Soft. Slow.",
  "@scriptMoney24": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Steady with Money (recorded as meditate/money/24.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMoney25": "Now your legs and feet. Feel how solid the floor is beneath you. It holds you completely. You don't have to hold yourself up.",
  "@scriptMoney25": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Steady with Money (recorded as meditate/money/25.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMoney26": "Take a moment to search gently for anything still holding on… a tight brow, a clenched hand, a held breath. Wherever you find it, breathe in… and as you breathe out, let it melt away.",
  "@scriptMoney26": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Steady with Money (recorded as meditate/money/26.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMoney27": "Down through your hips… your legs… all the way to your feet on the floor. Grounded. Supported. Nothing to hold up right now.",
  "@scriptMoney27": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Steady with Money (recorded as meditate/money/27.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMoney28": "Your whole body… calm and heavy and safe. Enjoy this feeling for a few quiet breaths.",
  "@scriptMoney28": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Steady with Money (recorded as meditate/money/28.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMoney29": "Imagine you are a tree on a hill above the sea. The wind blows… sometimes strongly.",
  "@scriptMoney29": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Steady with Money (recorded as meditate/money/29.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMoney30": "But beneath you, your roots reach deep into the earth, wider than your branches. Whatever the weather, you are held. You are rooted.",
  "@scriptMoney30": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Steady with Money (recorded as meditate/money/30.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMoney31": "And as you rest here, let these words settle somewhere deep, where they can quietly work for you:",
  "@scriptMoney31": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Steady with Money (recorded as meditate/money/31.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMoney32": "One clear step is worth more than a hundred worries.",
  "@scriptMoney32": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Steady with Money (recorded as meditate/money/32.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMoney33": "You can face this calmly, one number at a time.",
  "@scriptMoney33": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Steady with Money (recorded as meditate/money/33.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMoney34": "Your value is not your bank balance.",
  "@scriptMoney34": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Steady with Money (recorded as meditate/money/34.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMoney35": "Now, gently press your feet firmly into the floor.",
  "@scriptMoney35": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Steady with Money (recorded as meditate/money/35.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMoney36": "Take one slow breath… and silently say to yourself: Rooted and steady.",
  "@scriptMoney36": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Steady with Money (recorded as meditate/money/36.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMoney37": "Feel this calm gathering here. From now on, when you open a bill, check your balance, or start to worry at night, you can do this again… take one breath… and this same calm will return, a little stronger each time.",
  "@scriptMoney37": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Steady with Money (recorded as meditate/money/37.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMoney38": "Let it go now.",
  "@scriptMoney38": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Steady with Money (recorded as meditate/money/38.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMoney39": "Rest here now… nothing to do, nowhere to be… just letting the calm settle in, deeper with every breath.",
  "@scriptMoney39": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Steady with Money (recorded as meditate/money/39.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMoney40": "Before we come back… Think of one small, clear step you could take with money this week. Only one.",
  "@scriptMoney40": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Steady with Money (recorded as meditate/money/40.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMoney41": "See yourself doing it calmly.",
  "@scriptMoney41": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Steady with Money (recorded as meditate/money/41.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMoney42": "Now I'll count from one to five. With each number you'll feel more awake, more alert… bringing the calm back with you.",
  "@scriptMoney42": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Steady with Money (recorded as meditate/money/42.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMoney43": "One… noticing what's beneath you.",
  "@scriptMoney43": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Steady with Money (recorded as meditate/money/43.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMoney44": "Two… sounds of the room returning.",
  "@scriptMoney44": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Steady with Money (recorded as meditate/money/44.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMoney45": "Three… a deeper breath, wiggling your fingers and toes.",
  "@scriptMoney45": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Steady with Money (recorded as meditate/money/45.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMoney46": "Four… energy flowing back, clear and focused.",
  "@scriptMoney46": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Steady with Money (recorded as meditate/money/46.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMoney47": "And five… eyes open when you're ready… calm, clear and ready.",
  "@scriptMoney47": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Steady with Money (recorded as meditate/money/47.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMoney48": "Well done. Remember: Rooted and steady. I'm here with you.",
  "@scriptMoney48": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Steady with Money (recorded as meditate/money/48.mp3)."
  },
