    "description": "Spoken line of Burnout Recovery (recorded as meditate/burnout/03.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptBurnout04": "Now let your eyes find one small point in front of you… and simply rest your gaze there.",
  "@scriptBurnout04": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Burnout Recovery (recorded as meditate/burnout/04.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptBurnout05": "Keep looking at it… and notice how your eyelids may start to feel a little heavier… a little slower to blink.",
  "@scriptBurnout05": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Burnout Recovery (recorded as meditate/burnout/05.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptBurnout06": "There's nothing you need to do right. Whenever they're ready… you can let your eyes close.",
  "@scriptBurnout06": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Burnout Recovery (recorded as meditate/burnout/06.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptBurnout07": "Let's slow the breath together. A longer out-breath tells your body you are safe.",
  "@scriptBurnout07": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Burnout Recovery (recorded as meditate/burnout/07.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptBurnout08": "Breathe in… two… three… four. And out… two… three… four… five… six.",
  "@scriptBurnout08": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Burnout Recovery (recorded as meditate/burnout/08.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptBurnout09": "Again. In… two… three… four. And slowly out… letting the shoulders fall… five… six.",
  "@scriptBurnout09": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Burnout Recovery (recorded as meditate/burnout/09.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptBurnout10": "Good. Let the breath find its own rhythm now.",
  "@scriptBurnout10": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Burnout Recovery (recorded as meditate/burnout/10.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptBurnout11": "In a moment I'll count down from ten to one. With each number, you can drift twice as deep into calm… and you don't have to try. Just listen.",
  "@scriptBurnout11": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Burnout Recovery (recorded as meditate/burnout/11.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptBurnout12": "Ten… letting go.",
  "@scriptBurnout12": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Burnout Recovery (recorded as meditate/burnout/12.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptBurnout13": "Nine… softer now.",
  "@scriptBurnout13": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Burnout Recovery (recorded as meditate/burnout/13.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptBurnout14": "Eight… the noise of the day moving further away.",
  "@scriptBurnout14": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Burnout Recovery (recorded as meditate/burnout/14.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptBurnout15": "Seven…",
  "@scriptBurnout15": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Burnout Recovery (recorded as meditate/burnout/15.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptBurnout16": "Six… deeper and calmer.",
  "@scriptBurnout16": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Burnout Recovery (recorded as meditate/burnout/16.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptBurnout17": "Five… halfway down, and comfortable.",
  "@scriptBurnout17": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Burnout Recovery (recorded as meditate/burnout/17.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptBurnout18": "Four…",
  "@scriptBurnout18": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Burnout Recovery (recorded as meditate/burnout/18.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptBurnout19": "Three… every breath carrying you down.",
  "@scriptBurnout19": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Burnout Recovery (recorded as meditate/burnout/19.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptBurnout20": "Two… almost there.",
  "@scriptBurnout20": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Burnout Recovery (recorded as meditate/burnout/20.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptBurnout21": "And one.",
  "@scriptBurnout21": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Burnout Recovery (recorded as meditate/burnout/21.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptBurnout22": "Resting here. Quiet. Safe.",
  "@scriptBurnout22": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Burnout Recovery (recorded as meditate/burnout/22.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptBurnout23": "Now let's move slowly through your body… and let the tension soften, wherever it's hiding.",
  "@scriptBurnout23": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Burnout Recovery (recorded as meditate/burnout/23.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptBurnout24": "Let your whole body become heavy. Your head heavy on your neck. Your arms heavy at your sides. Your legs heavy on the floor.",
  "@scriptBurnout24": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Burnout Recovery (recorded as meditate/burnout/24.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptBurnout25": "Notice the tiredness without judging it. It's a signal, not a failure. Breathe into the tired places… and let them rest completely.",
  "@scriptBurnout25": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Burnout Recovery (recorded as meditate/burnout/25.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptBurnout26": "Take a moment to search gently for anything still holding on… a tight brow, a clenched hand, a held breath. Wherever you find it, breathe in… and as you breathe out, let it melt away.",
  "@scriptBurnout26": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Burnout Recovery (recorded as meditate/burnout/26.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptBurnout27": "Down through your hips… your legs… all the way to your feet on the floor. Grounded. Supported. Nothing to hold up right now.",
  "@scriptBurnout27": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Burnout Recovery (recorded as meditate/burnout/27.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptBurnout28": "Your whole body… calm and heavy and safe. Enjoy this feeling for a few quiet breaths.",
  "@scriptBurnout28": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Burnout Recovery (recorded as meditate/burnout/28.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptBurnout29": "Imagine floating in warm, shallow water near the shore. The sea holds you up. You don't need to swim.",
  "@scriptBurnout29": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Burnout Recovery (recorded as meditate/burnout/29.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptBurnout30": "Sunlight warms your skin, and with every breath you feel it pouring into you… slowly refilling you, like a battery charging, one percent at a time.",
  "@scriptBurnout30": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Burnout Recovery (recorded as meditate/burnout/30.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptBurnout31": "And as you rest here, let these words settle somewhere deep, where they can quietly work for you:",
  "@scriptBurnout31": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Burnout Recovery (recorded as meditate/burnout/31.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptBurnout32": "Rest is not a reward. It is a requirement.",
  "@scriptBurnout32": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Burnout Recovery (recorded as meditate/burnout/32.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptBurnout33": "You are more than what you produce.",
  "@scriptBurnout33": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Burnout Recovery (recorded as meditate/burnout/33.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptBurnout34": "Small recovery counts.",
  "@scriptBurnout34": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Burnout Recovery (recorded as meditate/burnout/34.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptBurnout35": "Now, gently rest one hand on your belly.",
  "@scriptBurnout35": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Burnout Recovery (recorded as meditate/burnout/35.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptBurnout36": "Take one slow breath… and silently say to yourself: Refill before I give.",
  "@scriptBurnout36": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Burnout Recovery (recorded as meditate/burnout/36.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptBurnout37": "Feel this calm gathering here. From now on, when you feel drained, or before saying yes to one more thing, you can do this again… take one breath… and this same calm will return, a little stronger each time.",
  "@scriptBurnout37": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Burnout Recovery (recorded as meditate/burnout/37.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptBurnout38": "Let it go now.",
  "@scriptBurnout38": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Burnout Recovery (recorded as meditate/burnout/38.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptBurnout39": "Rest here now… nothing to do, nowhere to be… just letting the calm settle in, deeper with every breath.",
  "@scriptBurnout39": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Burnout Recovery (recorded as meditate/burnout/39.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptBurnout40": "Before we come back… Choose one small way you'll rest or recharge today.",
  "@scriptBurnout40": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Burnout Recovery (recorded as meditate/burnout/40.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptBurnout41": "See yourself doing it calmly.",
  "@scriptBurnout41": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Burnout Recovery (recorded as meditate/burnout/41.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptBurnout42": "Now I'll count from one to five. With each number you'll feel more awake, more alert… bringing the calm back with you.",
  "@scriptBurnout42": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Burnout Recovery (recorded as meditate/burnout/42.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptBurnout43": "One… noticing what's beneath you.",
  "@scriptBurnout43": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Burnout Recovery (recorded as meditate/burnout/43.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptBurnout44": "Two… sounds of the room returning.",
  "@scriptBurnout44": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Burnout Recovery (recorded as meditate/burnout/44.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptBurnout45": "Three… a deeper breath, wiggling your fingers and toes.",
  "@scriptBurnout45": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Burnout Recovery (recorded as meditate/burnout/45.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptBurnout46": "Four… energy flowing back, clear and focused.",
  "@scriptBurnout46": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Burnout Recovery (recorded as meditate/burnout/46.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptBurnout47": "And five… eyes open when you're ready… calm, clear and ready.",
  "@scriptBurnout47": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Burnout Recovery (recorded as meditate/burnout/47.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptBurnout48": "Well done. Remember: Refill before I give. I'm here with you.",
  "@scriptBurnout48": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Burnout Recovery (recorded as meditate/burnout/48.mp3)."
  },
  "meditateJobSecurityTitle": "Steady Ground",
