  },
  "scriptGrades19": "Three… every breath carrying you down.",
  "@scriptGrades19": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Beyond the Grade (recorded as meditate/grades/19.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptGrades20": "Two… almost there.",
  "@scriptGrades20": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Beyond the Grade (recorded as meditate/grades/20.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptGrades21": "And one.",
  "@scriptGrades21": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Beyond the Grade (recorded as meditate/grades/21.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptGrades22": "Resting here. Quiet. Safe.",
  "@scriptGrades22": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Beyond the Grade (recorded as meditate/grades/22.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptGrades23": "Now let's move slowly through your body… and let the tension soften, wherever it's hiding.",
  "@scriptGrades23": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Beyond the Grade (recorded as meditate/grades/23.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptGrades24": "Bring your attention to your chest. Pressure often sits here. Breathe into it gently… and let it widen.",
  "@scriptGrades24": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Beyond the Grade (recorded as meditate/grades/24.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptGrades25": "Now your shoulders, carrying expectations from yourself and from others. Let them drop. You don't have to carry those right now.",
  "@scriptGrades25": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Beyond the Grade (recorded as meditate/grades/25.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptGrades26": "Take a moment to search gently for anything still holding on… a tight brow, a clenched hand, a held breath. Wherever you find it, breathe in… and as you breathe out, let it melt away.",
  "@scriptGrades26": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Beyond the Grade (recorded as meditate/grades/26.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptGrades27": "Down through your hips… your legs… all the way to your feet on the floor. Grounded. Supported. Nothing to hold up right now.",
  "@scriptGrades27": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Beyond the Grade (recorded as meditate/grades/27.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptGrades28": "Your whole body… calm and heavy and safe. Enjoy this feeling for a few quiet breaths.",
  "@scriptGrades28": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Beyond the Grade (recorded as meditate/grades/28.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptGrades29": "Imagine a colorful kite flying high above the beach. The wind lifts it and dips it… but it keeps flying.",
  "@scriptGrades29": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Beyond the Grade (recorded as meditate/grades/29.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptGrades30": "Its string is held gently in your hand. Not too tight. Just enough. You can hold your goals the same way.",
  "@scriptGrades30": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Beyond the Grade (recorded as meditate/grades/30.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptGrades31": "And as you rest here, let these words settle somewhere deep, where they can quietly work for you:",
  "@scriptGrades31": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Beyond the Grade (recorded as meditate/grades/31.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptGrades32": "A grade is information, not a verdict on who you are.",
  "@scriptGrades32": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Beyond the Grade (recorded as meditate/grades/32.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptGrades33": "Effort is growth, whatever the result.",
  "@scriptGrades33": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Beyond the Grade (recorded as meditate/grades/33.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptGrades34": "You are allowed to learn at your own pace.",
  "@scriptGrades34": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Beyond the Grade (recorded as meditate/grades/34.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptGrades35": "Now, gently place a hand on your chest.",
  "@scriptGrades35": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Beyond the Grade (recorded as meditate/grades/35.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptGrades36": "Take one slow breath… and silently say to yourself: I am more than a score.",
  "@scriptGrades36": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Beyond the Grade (recorded as meditate/grades/36.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptGrades37": "Feel this calm gathering here. From now on, when you get a result back, or start comparing yourself to others, you can do this again… take one breath… and this same calm will return, a little stronger each time.",
  "@scriptGrades37": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Beyond the Grade (recorded as meditate/grades/37.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptGrades38": "Let it go now.",
  "@scriptGrades38": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Beyond the Grade (recorded as meditate/grades/38.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptGrades39": "Rest here now… nothing to do, nowhere to be… just letting the calm settle in, deeper with every breath.",
  "@scriptGrades39": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Beyond the Grade (recorded as meditate/grades/39.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptGrades40": "Before we come back… Think of one thing you learned this week, no matter the grade.",
  "@scriptGrades40": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Beyond the Grade (recorded as meditate/grades/40.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptGrades41": "See yourself doing it calmly.",
  "@scriptGrades41": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Beyond the Grade (recorded as meditate/grades/41.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptGrades42": "Now I'll count from one to five. With each number you'll feel more awake, more alert… bringing the calm back with you.",
  "@scriptGrades42": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Beyond the Grade (recorded as meditate/grades/42.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptGrades43": "One… noticing what's beneath you.",
  "@scriptGrades43": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Beyond the Grade (recorded as meditate/grades/43.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptGrades44": "Two… sounds of the room returning.",
  "@scriptGrades44": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Beyond the Grade (recorded as meditate/grades/44.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptGrades45": "Three… a deeper breath, wiggling your fingers and toes.",
  "@scriptGrades45": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Beyond the Grade (recorded as meditate/grades/45.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptGrades46": "Four… energy flowing back, clear and focused.",
  "@scriptGrades46": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Beyond the Grade (recorded as meditate/grades/46.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptGrades47": "And five… eyes open when you're ready… calm, clear and ready.",
  "@scriptGrades47": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Beyond the Grade (recorded as meditate/grades/47.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptGrades48": "Well done. Remember: I am more than a score. I'm here with you.",
  "@scriptGrades48": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Beyond the Grade (recorded as meditate/grades/48.mp3)."
  },
  "meditateTeachersTitle": "Speak Up Calmly",
  "@meditateTeachersTitle": {
    "description": "A school meditation."
  },
  "afterAnchorTeachers": "Relax your tongue · “My voice matters.”",
  "@afterAnchorTeachers": {
    "description": "The anchor card after Speak Up Calmly: the gesture and its words."
  },
  "scriptTeachers01": "Hi. I'm here with you.",
  "@scriptTeachers01": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Speak Up Calmly (recorded as meditate/teachers/01.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptTeachers02": "Raising your hand or speaking up can feel scary. For these ten minutes, let's give your voice a calm place to grow.",
  "@scriptTeachers02": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Speak Up Calmly (recorded as meditate/teachers/02.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptTeachers03": "Find a position where your body is supported. Feet flat on the floor. Hands resting wherever they want to rest.",
  "@scriptTeachers03": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Speak Up Calmly (recorded as meditate/teachers/03.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptTeachers04": "Now let your eyes find one small point in front of you… and simply rest your gaze there.",
  "@scriptTeachers04": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Speak Up Calmly (recorded as meditate/teachers/04.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptTeachers05": "Keep looking at it… and notice how your eyelids may start to feel a little heavier… a little slower to blink.",
  "@scriptTeachers05": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Speak Up Calmly (recorded as meditate/teachers/05.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptTeachers06": "There's nothing you need to do right. Whenever they're ready… you can let your eyes close.",
  "@scriptTeachers06": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Speak Up Calmly (recorded as meditate/teachers/06.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptTeachers07": "Let's slow the breath together. A longer out-breath tells your body you are safe.",
  "@scriptTeachers07": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Speak Up Calmly (recorded as meditate/teachers/07.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptTeachers08": "Breathe in… two… three… four. And out… two… three… four… five… six.",
  "@scriptTeachers08": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Speak Up Calmly (recorded as meditate/teachers/08.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptTeachers09": "Again. In… two… three… four. And slowly out… letting the shoulders fall… five… six.",
  "@scriptTeachers09": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Speak Up Calmly (recorded as meditate/teachers/09.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptTeachers10": "Good. Let the breath find its own rhythm now.",
  "@scriptTeachers10": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Speak Up Calmly (recorded as meditate/teachers/10.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptTeachers11": "In a moment I'll count down from ten to one. With each number, you can drift twice as deep into calm… and you don't have to try. Just listen.",
  "@scriptTeachers11": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Speak Up Calmly (recorded as meditate/teachers/11.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptTeachers12": "Ten… letting go.",
  "@scriptTeachers12": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Speak Up Calmly (recorded as meditate/teachers/12.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptTeachers13": "Nine… softer now.",
  "@scriptTeachers13": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Speak Up Calmly (recorded as meditate/teachers/13.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptTeachers14": "Eight… the noise of the day moving further away.",
  "@scriptTeachers14": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Speak Up Calmly (recorded as meditate/teachers/14.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptTeachers15": "Seven…",
  "@scriptTeachers15": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Speak Up Calmly (recorded as meditate/teachers/15.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptTeachers16": "Six… deeper and calmer.",
  "@scriptTeachers16": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Speak Up Calmly (recorded as meditate/teachers/16.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptTeachers17": "Five… halfway down, and comfortable.",
  "@scriptTeachers17": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Speak Up Calmly (recorded as meditate/teachers/17.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptTeachers18": "Four…",
  "@scriptTeachers18": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Speak Up Calmly (recorded as meditate/teachers/18.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptTeachers19": "Three… every breath carrying you down.",
  "@scriptTeachers19": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Speak Up Calmly (recorded as meditate/teachers/19.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptTeachers20": "Two… almost there.",
  "@scriptTeachers20": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Speak Up Calmly (recorded as meditate/teachers/20.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptTeachers21": "And one.",
  "@scriptTeachers21": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Speak Up Calmly (recorded as meditate/teachers/21.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptTeachers22": "Resting here. Quiet. Safe.",
  "@scriptTeachers22": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Speak Up Calmly (recorded as meditate/teachers/22.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptTeachers23": "Now let's move slowly through your body… and let the tension soften, wherever it's hiding.",
  "@scriptTeachers23": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Speak Up Calmly (recorded as meditate/teachers/23.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptTeachers24": "Bring your attention to your throat. Let it relax and open. Swallow gently.",
  "@scriptTeachers24": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Speak Up Calmly (recorded as meditate/teachers/24.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptTeachers25": "Now your jaw and tongue. Let your tongue rest softly in your mouth. Let your jaw hang loose.",
  "@scriptTeachers25": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Speak Up Calmly (recorded as meditate/teachers/25.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptTeachers26": "Take a moment to search gently for anything still holding on… a tight brow, a clenched hand, a held breath. Wherever you find it, breathe in… and as you breathe out, let it melt away.",
  "@scriptTeachers26": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Speak Up Calmly (recorded as meditate/teachers/26.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptTeachers27": "Down through your hips… your legs… all the way to your feet on the floor. Grounded. Supported. Nothing to hold up right now.",
  "@scriptTeachers27": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Speak Up Calmly (recorded as meditate/teachers/27.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptTeachers28": "Your whole body… calm and heavy and safe. Enjoy this feeling for a few quiet breaths.",
  "@scriptTeachers28": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Speak Up Calmly (recorded as meditate/teachers/28.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptTeachers29": "Imagine your voice as a calm wave rolling toward the shore.",
  "@scriptTeachers29": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Speak Up Calmly (recorded as meditate/teachers/29.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptTeachers30": "It doesn't need to be loud. It simply arrives, clear and steady, and reaches the sand. Everyone on the beach can hear it.",
  "@scriptTeachers30": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Speak Up Calmly (recorded as meditate/teachers/30.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptTeachers31": "And as you rest here, let these words settle somewhere deep, where they can quietly work for you:",
  "@scriptTeachers31": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Speak Up Calmly (recorded as meditate/teachers/31.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptTeachers32": "Your questions deserve space. Asking is a strength.",
  "@scriptTeachers32": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Speak Up Calmly (recorded as meditate/teachers/32.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptTeachers33": "You can speak calmly, even when you feel nervous.",
  "@scriptTeachers33": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Speak Up Calmly (recorded as meditate/teachers/33.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptTeachers34": "Mistakes are how everyone learns.",
  "@scriptTeachers34": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Speak Up Calmly (recorded as meditate/teachers/34.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptTeachers35": "Now, gently relax your tongue and swallow.",
  "@scriptTeachers35": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Speak Up Calmly (recorded as meditate/teachers/35.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptTeachers36": "Take one slow breath… and silently say to yourself: My voice matters.",
  "@scriptTeachers36": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Speak Up Calmly (recorded as meditate/teachers/36.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptTeachers37": "Feel this calm gathering here. From now on, before asking a question in class, or talking to a teacher, you can do this again… take one breath… and this same calm will return, a little stronger each time.",
  "@scriptTeachers37": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Speak Up Calmly (recorded as meditate/teachers/37.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptTeachers38": "Let it go now.",
  "@scriptTeachers38": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Speak Up Calmly (recorded as meditate/teachers/38.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptTeachers39": "Rest here now… nothing to do, nowhere to be… just letting the calm settle in, deeper with every breath.",
  "@scriptTeachers39": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Speak Up Calmly (recorded as meditate/teachers/39.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptTeachers40": "Before we come back… Choose one question you'll ask, or one thing you'll say, this week.",
  "@scriptTeachers40": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Speak Up Calmly (recorded as meditate/teachers/40.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptTeachers41": "See yourself doing it calmly.",
  "@scriptTeachers41": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Speak Up Calmly (recorded as meditate/teachers/41.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptTeachers42": "Now I'll count from one to five. With each number you'll feel more awake, more alert… bringing the calm back with you.",
  "@scriptTeachers42": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Speak Up Calmly (recorded as meditate/teachers/42.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptTeachers43": "One… noticing what's beneath you.",
  "@scriptTeachers43": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Speak Up Calmly (recorded as meditate/teachers/43.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptTeachers44": "Two… sounds of the room returning.",
  "@scriptTeachers44": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Speak Up Calmly (recorded as meditate/teachers/44.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptTeachers45": "Three… a deeper breath, wiggling your fingers and toes.",
  "@scriptTeachers45": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Speak Up Calmly (recorded as meditate/teachers/45.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptTeachers46": "Four… energy flowing back, clear and focused.",
  "@scriptTeachers46": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Speak Up Calmly (recorded as meditate/teachers/46.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptTeachers47": "And five… eyes open when you're ready… calm, clear and ready.",
  "@scriptTeachers47": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Speak Up Calmly (recorded as meditate/teachers/47.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptTeachers48": "Well done. Remember: My voice matters. I'm here with you.",
  "@scriptTeachers48": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Speak Up Calmly (recorded as meditate/teachers/48.mp3)."
  },
