  },
  "scriptClassmates20": "Two… almost there.",
  "@scriptClassmates20": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Fitting In (recorded as meditate/classmates/20.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptClassmates21": "And one.",
  "@scriptClassmates21": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Fitting In (recorded as meditate/classmates/21.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptClassmates22": "Resting here. Quiet. Safe.",
  "@scriptClassmates22": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Fitting In (recorded as meditate/classmates/22.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptClassmates23": "Now let's move slowly through your body… and let the tension soften, wherever it's hiding.",
  "@scriptClassmates23": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Fitting In (recorded as meditate/classmates/23.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptClassmates24": "Bring your attention to your stomach. Notice any worry about what others think. Breathe into it softly.",
  "@scriptClassmates24": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Fitting In (recorded as meditate/classmates/24.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptClassmates25": "Now your shoulders. Let them relax away from your ears, as if no one is watching.",
  "@scriptClassmates25": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Fitting In (recorded as meditate/classmates/25.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptClassmates26": "Take a moment to search gently for anything still holding on… a tight brow, a clenched hand, a held breath. Wherever you find it, breathe in… and as you breathe out, let it melt away.",
  "@scriptClassmates26": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Fitting In (recorded as meditate/classmates/26.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptClassmates27": "Down through your hips… your legs… all the way to your feet on the floor. Grounded. Supported. Nothing to hold up right now.",
  "@scriptClassmates27": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Fitting In (recorded as meditate/classmates/27.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptClassmates28": "Your whole body… calm and heavy and safe. Enjoy this feeling for a few quiet breaths.",
  "@scriptClassmates28": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Fitting In (recorded as meditate/classmates/28.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptClassmates29": "Picture a flock of birds flying over the sea. Together… yet each one has its own shape, its own rhythm.",
  "@scriptClassmates29": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Fitting In (recorded as meditate/classmates/29.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptClassmates30": "No bird tries to be another. They fly together because each one is free.",
  "@scriptClassmates30": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Fitting In (recorded as meditate/classmates/30.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptClassmates31": "And as you rest here, let these words settle somewhere deep, where they can quietly work for you:",
  "@scriptClassmates31": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Fitting In (recorded as meditate/classmates/31.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptClassmates32": "You belong without having to become someone else.",
  "@scriptClassmates32": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Fitting In (recorded as meditate/classmates/32.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptClassmates33": "The right people will like the real you.",
  "@scriptClassmates33": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Fitting In (recorded as meditate/classmates/33.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptClassmates34": "You can say no and still be liked.",
  "@scriptClassmates34": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Fitting In (recorded as meditate/classmates/34.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptClassmates35": "Now, gently let a soft smile come to your face.",
  "@scriptClassmates35": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Fitting In (recorded as meditate/classmates/35.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptClassmates36": "Take one slow breath… and silently say to yourself: I belong as I am.",
  "@scriptClassmates36": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Fitting In (recorded as meditate/classmates/36.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptClassmates37": "Feel this calm gathering here. From now on, when you feel left out, or pressured to be someone you're not, you can do this again… take one breath… and this same calm will return, a little stronger each time.",
  "@scriptClassmates37": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Fitting In (recorded as meditate/classmates/37.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptClassmates38": "Let it go now.",
  "@scriptClassmates38": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Fitting In (recorded as meditate/classmates/38.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptClassmates39": "Rest here now… nothing to do, nowhere to be… just letting the calm settle in, deeper with every breath.",
  "@scriptClassmates39": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Fitting In (recorded as meditate/classmates/39.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptClassmates40": "Before we come back… Think of one person you feel comfortable around, and how you could spend time with them.",
  "@scriptClassmates40": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Fitting In (recorded as meditate/classmates/40.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptClassmates41": "See yourself doing it calmly.",
  "@scriptClassmates41": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Fitting In (recorded as meditate/classmates/41.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptClassmates42": "Now I'll count from one to five. With each number you'll feel more awake, more alert… bringing the calm back with you.",
  "@scriptClassmates42": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Fitting In (recorded as meditate/classmates/42.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptClassmates43": "One… noticing what's beneath you.",
  "@scriptClassmates43": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Fitting In (recorded as meditate/classmates/43.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptClassmates44": "Two… sounds of the room returning.",
  "@scriptClassmates44": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Fitting In (recorded as meditate/classmates/44.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptClassmates45": "Three… a deeper breath, wiggling your fingers and toes.",
  "@scriptClassmates45": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Fitting In (recorded as meditate/classmates/45.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptClassmates46": "Four… energy flowing back, clear and focused.",
  "@scriptClassmates46": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Fitting In (recorded as meditate/classmates/46.mp3)."
