    "description": "Spoken line of Before You Walk In (recorded as meditate/events/28.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptEvents29": "Picture yourself walking into a room filled with soft golden light.",
  "@scriptEvents29": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Before You Walk In (recorded as meditate/events/29.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptEvents30": "People turn and smile. Someone waves. You feel welcome, at ease. You don't need to impress anyone. You're simply here.",
  "@scriptEvents30": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Before You Walk In (recorded as meditate/events/30.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptEvents31": "And as you rest here, let these words settle somewhere deep, where they can quietly work for you:",
  "@scriptEvents31": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Before You Walk In (recorded as meditate/events/31.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptEvents32": "You do not have to perform. Being yourself is enough.",
  "@scriptEvents32": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Before You Walk In (recorded as meditate/events/32.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptEvents33": "Most people are thinking about themselves, not judging you.",
  "@scriptEvents33": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Before You Walk In (recorded as meditate/events/33.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptEvents34": "You can step outside for a breath anytime.",
  "@scriptEvents34": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Before You Walk In (recorded as meditate/events/34.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptEvents35": "Now, gently press your thumb and index finger together.",
  "@scriptEvents35": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Before You Walk In (recorded as meditate/events/35.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptEvents36": "Take one slow breath… and silently say to yourself: I am enough as I am.",
  "@scriptEvents36": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Before You Walk In (recorded as meditate/events/36.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptEvents37": "Feel this calm gathering here. From now on, at the door of an event, or before meeting new people, you can do this again… take one breath… and this same calm will return, a little stronger each time.",
  "@scriptEvents37": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Before You Walk In (recorded as meditate/events/37.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptEvents38": "Let it go now.",
  "@scriptEvents38": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Before You Walk In (recorded as meditate/events/38.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptEvents39": "Rest here now… nothing to do, nowhere to be… just letting the calm settle in, deeper with every breath.",
  "@scriptEvents39": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Before You Walk In (recorded as meditate/events/39.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptEvents40": "Before we come back… Choose one small, easy thing you'll do at your next event… like one hello.",
  "@scriptEvents40": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Before You Walk In (recorded as meditate/events/40.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptEvents41": "See yourself doing it calmly.",
  "@scriptEvents41": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Before You Walk In (recorded as meditate/events/41.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptEvents42": "Now I'll count from one to five. With each number you'll feel more awake, more alert… bringing the calm back with you.",
  "@scriptEvents42": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Before You Walk In (recorded as meditate/events/42.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptEvents43": "One… noticing what's beneath you.",
  "@scriptEvents43": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Before You Walk In (recorded as meditate/events/43.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptEvents44": "Two… sounds of the room returning.",
  "@scriptEvents44": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Before You Walk In (recorded as meditate/events/44.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptEvents45": "Three… a deeper breath, wiggling your fingers and toes.",
  "@scriptEvents45": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Before You Walk In (recorded as meditate/events/45.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptEvents46": "Four… energy flowing back, clear and focused.",
  "@scriptEvents46": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Before You Walk In (recorded as meditate/events/46.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptEvents47": "And five… eyes open when you're ready… calm, clear and ready.",
  "@scriptEvents47": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Before You Walk In (recorded as meditate/events/47.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptEvents48": "Well done. Remember: I am enough as I am. I'm here with you.",
  "@scriptEvents48": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Before You Walk In (recorded as meditate/events/48.mp3)."
  },
  "meditateLonelinessTitle": "Never Truly Alone",
  "@meditateLonelinessTitle": {
    "description": "A social meditation."
  },
  "afterAnchorLoneliness": "Hug yourself · “I'm with me.”",
  "@afterAnchorLoneliness": {
    "description": "The anchor card after Never Truly Alone: the gesture and its words."
  },
  "scriptLoneliness01": "Hi. I'm here with you.",
  "@scriptLoneliness01": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Never Truly Alone (recorded as meditate/loneliness/01.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptLoneliness02": "Loneliness can feel heavy and quiet. For these ten minutes, you're not alone. I'm here with you.",
  "@scriptLoneliness02": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Never Truly Alone (recorded as meditate/loneliness/02.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptLoneliness03": "Find a position where your body is supported. Feet flat on the floor. Hands resting wherever they want to rest.",
  "@scriptLoneliness03": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Never Truly Alone (recorded as meditate/loneliness/03.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptLoneliness04": "Now let your eyes find one small point in front of you… and simply rest your gaze there.",
  "@scriptLoneliness04": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Never Truly Alone (recorded as meditate/loneliness/04.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptLoneliness05": "Keep looking at it… and notice how your eyelids may start to feel a little heavier… a little slower to blink.",
  "@scriptLoneliness05": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Never Truly Alone (recorded as meditate/loneliness/05.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptLoneliness06": "There's nothing you need to do right. Whenever they're ready… you can let your eyes close.",
  "@scriptLoneliness06": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Never Truly Alone (recorded as meditate/loneliness/06.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptLoneliness07": "Let's slow the breath together. A longer out-breath tells your body you are safe.",
  "@scriptLoneliness07": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Never Truly Alone (recorded as meditate/loneliness/07.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptLoneliness08": "Breathe in… two… three… four. And out… two… three… four… five… six.",
  "@scriptLoneliness08": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Never Truly Alone (recorded as meditate/loneliness/08.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptLoneliness09": "Again. In… two… three… four. And slowly out… letting the shoulders fall… five… six.",
  "@scriptLoneliness09": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Never Truly Alone (recorded as meditate/loneliness/09.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptLoneliness10": "Good. Let the breath find its own rhythm now.",
  "@scriptLoneliness10": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Never Truly Alone (recorded as meditate/loneliness/10.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptLoneliness11": "In a moment I'll count down from ten to one. With each number, you can drift twice as deep into calm… and you don't have to try. Just listen.",
  "@scriptLoneliness11": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Never Truly Alone (recorded as meditate/loneliness/11.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptLoneliness12": "Ten… letting go.",
  "@scriptLoneliness12": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Never Truly Alone (recorded as meditate/loneliness/12.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptLoneliness13": "Nine… softer now.",
  "@scriptLoneliness13": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Never Truly Alone (recorded as meditate/loneliness/13.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptLoneliness14": "Eight… the noise of the day moving further away.",
  "@scriptLoneliness14": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Never Truly Alone (recorded as meditate/loneliness/14.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptLoneliness15": "Seven…",
  "@scriptLoneliness15": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Never Truly Alone (recorded as meditate/loneliness/15.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptLoneliness16": "Six… deeper and calmer.",
  "@scriptLoneliness16": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Never Truly Alone (recorded as meditate/loneliness/16.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptLoneliness17": "Five… halfway down, and comfortable.",
  "@scriptLoneliness17": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Never Truly Alone (recorded as meditate/loneliness/17.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptLoneliness18": "Four…",
  "@scriptLoneliness18": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Never Truly Alone (recorded as meditate/loneliness/18.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptLoneliness19": "Three… every breath carrying you down.",
  "@scriptLoneliness19": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Never Truly Alone (recorded as meditate/loneliness/19.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptLoneliness20": "Two… almost there.",
  "@scriptLoneliness20": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Never Truly Alone (recorded as meditate/loneliness/20.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptLoneliness21": "And one.",
  "@scriptLoneliness21": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Never Truly Alone (recorded as meditate/loneliness/21.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptLoneliness22": "Resting here. Quiet. Safe.",
  "@scriptLoneliness22": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Never Truly Alone (recorded as meditate/loneliness/22.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptLoneliness23": "Now let's move slowly through your body… and let the tension soften, wherever it's hiding.",
  "@scriptLoneliness23": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Never Truly Alone (recorded as meditate/loneliness/23.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptLoneliness24": "Bring your attention to your chest. Breathe into it gently, letting it feel full and warm.",
  "@scriptLoneliness24": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Never Truly Alone (recorded as meditate/loneliness/24.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptLoneliness25": "Now your arms. Slowly wrap them around yourself in a soft hug. Feel the warmth of your own care.",
  "@scriptLoneliness25": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Never Truly Alone (recorded as meditate/loneliness/25.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptLoneliness26": "Take a moment to search gently for anything still holding on… a tight brow, a clenched hand, a held breath. Wherever you find it, breathe in… and as you breathe out, let it melt away.",
  "@scriptLoneliness26": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Never Truly Alone (recorded as meditate/loneliness/26.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptLoneliness27": "Down through your hips… your legs… all the way to your feet on the floor. Grounded. Supported. Nothing to hold up right now.",
  "@scriptLoneliness27": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Never Truly Alone (recorded as meditate/loneliness/27.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptLoneliness28": "Your whole body… calm and heavy and safe. Enjoy this feeling for a few quiet breaths.",
  "@scriptLoneliness28": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Never Truly Alone (recorded as meditate/loneliness/28.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptLoneliness29": "Picture yourself sitting on the beach at sunset. The sky is painted gold and pink.",
  "@scriptLoneliness29": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Never Truly Alone (recorded as meditate/loneliness/29.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptLoneliness30": "Next to you sits your companion, quiet and kind, watching the waves with you. No words are needed. You're together.",
  "@scriptLoneliness30": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Never Truly Alone (recorded as meditate/loneliness/30.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptLoneliness31": "And as you rest here, let these words settle somewhere deep, where they can quietly work for you:",
  "@scriptLoneliness31": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Never Truly Alone (recorded as meditate/loneliness/31.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptLoneliness32": "Feeling alone is a moment, not who you are.",
  "@scriptLoneliness32": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Never Truly Alone (recorded as meditate/loneliness/32.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptLoneliness33": "You are worthy of connection.",
  "@scriptLoneliness33": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Never Truly Alone (recorded as meditate/loneliness/33.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptLoneliness34": "Reaching out is brave.",
  "@scriptLoneliness34": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Never Truly Alone (recorded as meditate/loneliness/34.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptLoneliness35": "Now, gently give yourself a gentle hug.",
  "@scriptLoneliness35": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Never Truly Alone (recorded as meditate/loneliness/35.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptLoneliness36": "Take one slow breath… and silently say to yourself: I'm with me.",
  "@scriptLoneliness36": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Never Truly Alone (recorded as meditate/loneliness/36.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptLoneliness37": "Feel this calm gathering here. From now on, on lonely evenings, or whenever you feel disconnected, you can do this again… take one breath… and this same calm will return, a little stronger each time.",
  "@scriptLoneliness37": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Never Truly Alone (recorded as meditate/loneliness/37.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptLoneliness38": "Let it go now.",
  "@scriptLoneliness38": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Never Truly Alone (recorded as meditate/loneliness/38.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptLoneliness39": "Rest here now… nothing to do, nowhere to be… just letting the calm settle in, deeper with every breath.",
  "@scriptLoneliness39": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Never Truly Alone (recorded as meditate/loneliness/39.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptLoneliness40": "Before we come back… Think of one small way you could connect with someone this week.",
  "@scriptLoneliness40": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Never Truly Alone (recorded as meditate/loneliness/40.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptLoneliness41": "See yourself doing it calmly.",
  "@scriptLoneliness41": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Never Truly Alone (recorded as meditate/loneliness/41.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptLoneliness42": "Now I'll count from one to five. With each number you'll feel more awake, more alert… bringing the calm back with you.",
  "@scriptLoneliness42": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Never Truly Alone (recorded as meditate/loneliness/42.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptLoneliness43": "One… noticing what's beneath you.",
  "@scriptLoneliness43": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Never Truly Alone (recorded as meditate/loneliness/43.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptLoneliness44": "Two… sounds of the room returning.",
  "@scriptLoneliness44": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Never Truly Alone (recorded as meditate/loneliness/44.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptLoneliness45": "Three… a deeper breath, wiggling your fingers and toes.",
  "@scriptLoneliness45": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Never Truly Alone (recorded as meditate/loneliness/45.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptLoneliness46": "Four… energy flowing back, clear and focused.",
  "@scriptLoneliness46": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Never Truly Alone (recorded as meditate/loneliness/46.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptLoneliness47": "And five… eyes open when you're ready… calm, clear and ready.",
  "@scriptLoneliness47": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Never Truly Alone (recorded as meditate/loneliness/47.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptLoneliness48": "Well done. Remember: I'm with me. I'm here with you.",
  "@scriptLoneliness48": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Never Truly Alone (recorded as meditate/loneliness/48.mp3)."
  },
