  },
  "scriptSocialMedia22": "Resting here. Quiet. Safe.",
  "@scriptSocialMedia22": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Scroll Less, Breathe More (recorded as meditate/social_media/22.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialMedia23": "Now let's move slowly through your body… and let the tension soften, wherever it's hiding.",
  "@scriptSocialMedia23": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Scroll Less, Breathe More (recorded as meditate/social_media/23.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialMedia24": "Bring your attention to your eyes. Let them rest behind closed lids. Feel them soften.",
  "@scriptSocialMedia24": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Scroll Less, Breathe More (recorded as meditate/social_media/24.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialMedia25": "Now your neck, bent so often toward a screen. And your thumbs, always swiping. Let them be still.",
  "@scriptSocialMedia25": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Scroll Less, Breathe More (recorded as meditate/social_media/25.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialMedia26": "Take a moment to search gently for anything still holding on… a tight brow, a clenched hand, a held breath. Wherever you find it, breathe in… and as you breathe out, let it melt away.",
  "@scriptSocialMedia26": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Scroll Less, Breathe More (recorded as meditate/social_media/26.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialMedia27": "Down through your hips… your legs… all the way to your feet on the floor. Grounded. Supported. Nothing to hold up right now.",
  "@scriptSocialMedia27": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Scroll Less, Breathe More (recorded as meditate/social_media/27.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialMedia28": "Your whole body… calm and heavy and safe. Enjoy this feeling for a few quiet breaths.",
  "@scriptSocialMedia28": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Scroll Less, Breathe More (recorded as meditate/social_media/28.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialMedia29": "Imagine placing your phone face down on the sand.",
  "@scriptSocialMedia29": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Scroll Less, Breathe More (recorded as meditate/social_media/29.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialMedia30": "You look up at the real horizon… wide, blue, endless. The sound of the waves. The breeze. This moment can't be posted, and it's beautiful.",
  "@scriptSocialMedia30": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Scroll Less, Breathe More (recorded as meditate/social_media/30.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialMedia31": "And as you rest here, let these words settle somewhere deep, where they can quietly work for you:",
  "@scriptSocialMedia31": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Scroll Less, Breathe More (recorded as meditate/social_media/31.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialMedia32": "Their highlights are not your whole story.",
  "@scriptSocialMedia32": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Scroll Less, Breathe More (recorded as meditate/social_media/32.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialMedia33": "Your life is happening here, offline.",
  "@scriptSocialMedia33": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Scroll Less, Breathe More (recorded as meditate/social_media/33.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialMedia34": "You can close the app and come back to yourself.",
  "@scriptSocialMedia34": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Scroll Less, Breathe More (recorded as meditate/social_media/34.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialMedia35": "Now, gently turn your phone face down and take one breath.",
  "@scriptSocialMedia35": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Scroll Less, Breathe More (recorded as meditate/social_media/35.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialMedia36": "Take one slow breath… and silently say to yourself: Back to now.",
  "@scriptSocialMedia36": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Scroll Less, Breathe More (recorded as meditate/social_media/36.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialMedia37": "Feel this calm gathering here. From now on, when you notice yourself scrolling without thinking, or feeling worse after, you can do this again… take one breath… and this same calm will return, a little stronger each time.",
  "@scriptSocialMedia37": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Scroll Less, Breathe More (recorded as meditate/social_media/37.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialMedia38": "Let it go now.",
  "@scriptSocialMedia38": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Scroll Less, Breathe More (recorded as meditate/social_media/38.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialMedia39": "Rest here now… nothing to do, nowhere to be… just letting the calm settle in, deeper with every breath.",
  "@scriptSocialMedia39": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Scroll Less, Breathe More (recorded as meditate/social_media/39.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialMedia40": "Before we come back… Choose one time today you'll put your phone away for thirty minutes.",
  "@scriptSocialMedia40": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Scroll Less, Breathe More (recorded as meditate/social_media/40.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialMedia41": "See yourself doing it calmly.",
  "@scriptSocialMedia41": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Scroll Less, Breathe More (recorded as meditate/social_media/41.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialMedia42": "Now I'll count from one to five. With each number you'll feel more awake, more alert… bringing the calm back with you.",
  "@scriptSocialMedia42": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Scroll Less, Breathe More (recorded as meditate/social_media/42.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialMedia43": "One… noticing what's beneath you.",
  "@scriptSocialMedia43": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Scroll Less, Breathe More (recorded as meditate/social_media/43.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialMedia44": "Two… sounds of the room returning.",
  "@scriptSocialMedia44": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Scroll Less, Breathe More (recorded as meditate/social_media/44.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialMedia45": "Three… a deeper breath, wiggling your fingers and toes.",
  "@scriptSocialMedia45": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Scroll Less, Breathe More (recorded as meditate/social_media/45.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialMedia46": "Four… energy flowing back, clear and focused.",
  "@scriptSocialMedia46": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Scroll Less, Breathe More (recorded as meditate/social_media/46.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialMedia47": "And five… eyes open when you're ready… calm, clear and ready.",
  "@scriptSocialMedia47": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Scroll Less, Breathe More (recorded as meditate/social_media/47.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialMedia48": "Well done. Remember: Back to now. I'm here with you.",
  "@scriptSocialMedia48": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Scroll Less, Breathe More (recorded as meditate/social_media/48.mp3)."
  },
  "meditateSocialResetTitle": "Social Reset",
  "@meditateSocialResetTitle": {
    "description": "A social meditation."
  },
  "afterAnchorSocialReset": "One slow breath · “Recharged.”",
  "@afterAnchorSocialReset": {
    "description": "The anchor card after Social Reset: the gesture and its words."
  },
  "scriptSocialReset01": "Hi. I'm here with you.",
  "@scriptSocialReset01": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Social Reset (recorded as meditate/social_reset/01.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialReset02": "People can drain our energy, even people we love. For these ten minutes, you can recharge.",
  "@scriptSocialReset02": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Social Reset (recorded as meditate/social_reset/02.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialReset03": "Find a position where your body is supported. Feet flat on the floor. Hands resting wherever they want to rest.",
  "@scriptSocialReset03": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Social Reset (recorded as meditate/social_reset/03.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialReset04": "Now let your eyes find one small point in front of you… and simply rest your gaze there.",
  "@scriptSocialReset04": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Social Reset (recorded as meditate/social_reset/04.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialReset05": "Keep looking at it… and notice how your eyelids may start to feel a little heavier… a little slower to blink.",
  "@scriptSocialReset05": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Social Reset (recorded as meditate/social_reset/05.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialReset06": "There's nothing you need to do right. Whenever they're ready… you can let your eyes close.",
  "@scriptSocialReset06": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Social Reset (recorded as meditate/social_reset/06.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialReset07": "Let's slow the breath together. A longer out-breath tells your body you are safe.",
  "@scriptSocialReset07": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Social Reset (recorded as meditate/social_reset/07.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialReset08": "Breathe in… two… three… four. And out… two… three… four… five… six.",
  "@scriptSocialReset08": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Social Reset (recorded as meditate/social_reset/08.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialReset09": "Again. In… two… three… four. And slowly out… letting the shoulders fall… five… six.",
  "@scriptSocialReset09": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Social Reset (recorded as meditate/social_reset/09.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialReset10": "Good. Let the breath find its own rhythm now.",
  "@scriptSocialReset10": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Social Reset (recorded as meditate/social_reset/10.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialReset11": "In a moment I'll count down from ten to one. With each number, you can drift twice as deep into calm… and you don't have to try. Just listen.",
  "@scriptSocialReset11": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Social Reset (recorded as meditate/social_reset/11.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialReset12": "Ten… letting go.",
  "@scriptSocialReset12": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Social Reset (recorded as meditate/social_reset/12.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialReset13": "Nine… softer now.",
  "@scriptSocialReset13": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Social Reset (recorded as meditate/social_reset/13.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialReset14": "Eight… the noise of the day moving further away.",
  "@scriptSocialReset14": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Social Reset (recorded as meditate/social_reset/14.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialReset15": "Seven…",
  "@scriptSocialReset15": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Social Reset (recorded as meditate/social_reset/15.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialReset16": "Six… deeper and calmer.",
  "@scriptSocialReset16": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Social Reset (recorded as meditate/social_reset/16.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialReset17": "Five… halfway down, and comfortable.",
  "@scriptSocialReset17": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Social Reset (recorded as meditate/social_reset/17.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialReset18": "Four…",
  "@scriptSocialReset18": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Social Reset (recorded as meditate/social_reset/18.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialReset19": "Three… every breath carrying you down.",
  "@scriptSocialReset19": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Social Reset (recorded as meditate/social_reset/19.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialReset20": "Two… almost there.",
  "@scriptSocialReset20": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Social Reset (recorded as meditate/social_reset/20.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialReset21": "And one.",
  "@scriptSocialReset21": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Social Reset (recorded as meditate/social_reset/21.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialReset22": "Resting here. Quiet. Safe.",
  "@scriptSocialReset22": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Social Reset (recorded as meditate/social_reset/22.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialReset23": "Now let's move slowly through your body… and let the tension soften, wherever it's hiding.",
  "@scriptSocialReset23": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Social Reset (recorded as meditate/social_reset/23.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialReset24": "Move your attention slowly from head to toe. Wherever you feel drained, breathe in fresh energy.",
  "@scriptSocialReset24": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Social Reset (recorded as meditate/social_reset/24.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialReset25": "Let your whole body rest, heavy and comfortable.",
  "@scriptSocialReset25": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Social Reset (recorded as meditate/social_reset/25.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialReset26": "Take a moment to search gently for anything still holding on… a tight brow, a clenched hand, a held breath. Wherever you find it, breathe in… and as you breathe out, let it melt away.",
  "@scriptSocialReset26": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Social Reset (recorded as meditate/social_reset/26.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialReset27": "Down through your hips… your legs… all the way to your feet on the floor. Grounded. Supported. Nothing to hold up right now.",
  "@scriptSocialReset27": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Social Reset (recorded as meditate/social_reset/27.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialReset28": "Your whole body… calm and heavy and safe. Enjoy this feeling for a few quiet breaths.",
  "@scriptSocialReset28": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Social Reset (recorded as meditate/social_reset/28.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialReset29": "Imagine a quiet walk along the shore. Just you and the waves.",
  "@scriptSocialReset29": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Social Reset (recorded as meditate/social_reset/29.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialReset30": "Each step recharges you. The sea asks nothing of you. You can just walk, breathe and be.",
  "@scriptSocialReset30": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Social Reset (recorded as meditate/social_reset/30.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialReset31": "And as you rest here, let these words settle somewhere deep, where they can quietly work for you:",
  "@scriptSocialReset31": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Social Reset (recorded as meditate/social_reset/31.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialReset32": "You can take up space just as you are.",
  "@scriptSocialReset32": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Social Reset (recorded as meditate/social_reset/32.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialReset33": "Recharging alone is healthy.",
  "@scriptSocialReset33": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Social Reset (recorded as meditate/social_reset/33.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialReset34": "Your energy is worth protecting.",
  "@scriptSocialReset34": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Social Reset (recorded as meditate/social_reset/34.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialReset35": "Now, gently take one slow breath.",
  "@scriptSocialReset35": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Social Reset (recorded as meditate/social_reset/35.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialReset36": "Take one slow breath… and silently say to yourself: Recharged.",
  "@scriptSocialReset36": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Social Reset (recorded as meditate/social_reset/36.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialReset37": "Feel this calm gathering here. From now on, after social time, or when you feel drained by others, you can do this again… take one breath… and this same calm will return, a little stronger each time.",
  "@scriptSocialReset37": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Social Reset (recorded as meditate/social_reset/37.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialReset38": "Let it go now.",
  "@scriptSocialReset38": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Social Reset (recorded as meditate/social_reset/38.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialReset39": "Rest here now… nothing to do, nowhere to be… just letting the calm settle in, deeper with every breath.",
  "@scriptSocialReset39": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Social Reset (recorded as meditate/social_reset/39.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialReset40": "Before we come back… Choose one way you'll protect your energy this week.",
  "@scriptSocialReset40": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Social Reset (recorded as meditate/social_reset/40.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialReset41": "See yourself doing it calmly.",
  "@scriptSocialReset41": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Social Reset (recorded as meditate/social_reset/41.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialReset42": "Now I'll count from one to five. With each number you'll feel more awake, more alert… bringing the calm back with you.",
  "@scriptSocialReset42": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Social Reset (recorded as meditate/social_reset/42.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialReset43": "One… noticing what's beneath you.",
  "@scriptSocialReset43": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Social Reset (recorded as meditate/social_reset/43.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialReset44": "Two… sounds of the room returning.",
  "@scriptSocialReset44": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Social Reset (recorded as meditate/social_reset/44.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialReset45": "Three… a deeper breath, wiggling your fingers and toes.",
  "@scriptSocialReset45": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Social Reset (recorded as meditate/social_reset/45.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialReset46": "Four… energy flowing back, clear and focused.",
  "@scriptSocialReset46": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Social Reset (recorded as meditate/social_reset/46.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialReset47": "And five… eyes open when you're ready… calm, clear and ready.",
  "@scriptSocialReset47": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Social Reset (recorded as meditate/social_reset/47.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptSocialReset48": "Well done. Remember: Recharged. I'm here with you.",
  "@scriptSocialReset48": {
    "description": "Spoken line of Social Reset (recorded as meditate/social_reset/48.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptBodyScan01": "Hi. I'm here with you. Let's spend a few minutes noticing your body, one part at a time.",
  "@scriptBodyScan01": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as bodyscan/01.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptBodyScan02": "Sit or lie down somewhere comfortable. Let your eyes close, or rest your gaze on the floor.",
  "@scriptBodyScan02": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as bodyscan/02.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptBodyScan03": "Take a slow breath in… and a long breath out.",
  "@scriptBodyScan03": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as bodyscan/03.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptBodyScan04": "Bring your attention to the top of your head. Just notice what's there: warmth, tingling, or nothing at all.",
  "@scriptBodyScan04": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as bodyscan/04.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptBodyScan05": "Move down to your forehead and your eyes. If there's any tightness, let it soften as you breathe out.",
  "@scriptBodyScan05": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as bodyscan/05.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptBodyScan06": "Now your jaw. Let your teeth part a little and your tongue rest.",
  "@scriptBodyScan06": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as bodyscan/06.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptBodyScan07": "Notice your neck and shoulders. Let them grow heavy and drop away from your ears.",
  "@scriptBodyScan07": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as bodyscan/07.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptBodyScan08": "Feel your arms, your elbows, your wrists and your hands. Let your fingers rest, loose and still.",
  "@scriptBodyScan08": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as bodyscan/08.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptBodyScan09": "Bring your attention to your chest. Feel it rise and fall with each breath, without changing anything.",
  "@scriptBodyScan09": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as bodyscan/09.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptBodyScan10": "Notice your belly. If it feels tight, breathe into it gently, and let it soften.",
  "@scriptBodyScan10": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as bodyscan/10.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptBodyScan11": "Move to your lower back and your hips. Let them sink into whatever is holding you.",
  "@scriptBodyScan11": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as bodyscan/11.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptBodyScan12": "Feel your legs, your knees, and all the way down to your feet. Notice where they touch the floor.",
  "@scriptBodyScan12": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as bodyscan/12.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptBodyScan13": "Now feel your whole body at once, from head to toe, breathing calmly.",
  "@scriptBodyScan13": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as bodyscan/13.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptBodyScan14": "Whatever you noticed is okay. When you're ready, wiggle your fingers and toes, and open your eyes.",
  "@scriptBodyScan14": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as bodyscan/14.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMuscle01": "Hi. I'm here with you. We'll tense each group of muscles for a few seconds, then let it go. Never squeeze so hard that it hurts.",
  "@scriptMuscle01": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as muscle/01.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMuscle02": "Sit comfortably and take a slow breath in… and out.",
  "@scriptMuscle02": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as muscle/02.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMuscle03": "Make tight fists with both hands. Squeeze… and hold.",
  "@scriptMuscle03": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as muscle/03.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMuscle04": "And release. Let your hands fall open. Notice how different they feel.",
  "@scriptMuscle04": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as muscle/04.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMuscle05": "Now bend your arms and tighten the muscles in your upper arms. Hold.",
  "@scriptMuscle05": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as muscle/05.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMuscle06": "And let go. Let your arms rest, heavy and warm.",
  "@scriptMuscle06": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as muscle/06.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMuscle07": "Lift your shoulders up toward your ears. Hold them there.",
  "@scriptMuscle07": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as muscle/07.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMuscle08": "And drop them. Feel the tension slide away.",
  "@scriptMuscle08": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as muscle/08.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMuscle09": "Scrunch up your face: squeeze your eyes shut and press your lips together. Hold.",
  "@scriptMuscle09": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as muscle/09.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMuscle10": "And release. Let your forehead, your eyes and your jaw go soft.",
  "@scriptMuscle10": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as muscle/10.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMuscle11": "Take a deep breath in and hold it, tightening your chest and your stomach.",
  "@scriptMuscle11": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as muscle/11.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMuscle12": "And breathe out slowly, letting everything loosen.",
  "@scriptMuscle12": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as muscle/12.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMuscle13": "Press your knees together and tighten your legs. Hold.",
  "@scriptMuscle13": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as muscle/13.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMuscle14": "And relax. Let your legs grow heavy.",
  "@scriptMuscle14": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as muscle/14.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMuscle15": "Curl your toes down and tense your feet. Hold.",
  "@scriptMuscle15": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as muscle/15.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMuscle16": "And let go. Feel your feet relax completely.",
  "@scriptMuscle16": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as muscle/16.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMuscle17": "Now let your whole body rest. Notice how calm and heavy it feels.",
  "@scriptMuscle17": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as muscle/17.mp3)."
  },
  "scriptMuscle18": "When you're ready, take a deeper breath, stretch a little, and open your eyes.",
  "@scriptMuscle18": {
    "description": "Spoken line of a guided session (recorded as muscle/18.mp3)."
  }
}
